{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "62022",
 "name": "Hollow Eve Festival 447 (2023)",
 "file": "Hollow_Eve-2023.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":400,"x":100,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Exit","descriptions":["It's the ocean!"],"exits":[],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["exit","corral"]},
  {"id":1,"x":100,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, South Dock","descriptions":["Overhead, sea plants woven into a mat spread from pillars of coral to provide shade for the visiting land folk.  Small glass and crystal globes hang from the pillars.  Underfoot, the smooth sandstone is decorated with coral, shells, and gold.  Columns and domes rise up from the water surrounding the dock.  Cargo is being brought in by Merelew workers and then stacked on the dock for sorting.","Overhead, glowing crystal globes shed a soft green-yellow light on the dock.  Tall coral pillars rise from the sandstone to provide anchorage for the awning overhead.  The smooth sandstone of the dock is decorated with coral, shells, and gold.  In the water, glowing points of light give a glimpse of the true Merelew city.  Soft breezes blow through the pillars, and in the darkness, the sound of the sea murmurs unchanged."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":400,"exit":"go","move":"go corral"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go festive gate"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["dolphin","invitation","authorization","entrance","dock"]},
  {"id":2,"x":80,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Dock Extension","descriptions":["Signs of hasty construction abound -- from the rough edges of the timbers to the occasional nailhead not sunk completely into the wood.  An awning has been erected on the west side of the extension, helping to shelter visitors from the setting sun while they await entry into the festival.  A small sign is tacked to one of the awning's poles, its painted lettering showing haste with the drips running down the front of the plank."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":3,"x":100,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Middle Dock","descriptions":["Coral pillars rise from the sandstone of the dock to provide anchorage for a woven mat overhead.  The smooth sandstone slabs of the dock are decorated with interlocking circles made from corals, shells, and gold.  Crates soar in neat stacks, each labeled with the names of famous trading houses.  A few bear the seal of the Merelew, indicating that they are being shipped landside.  A group of Halflings moves cargo about.","Coral pillars seem to twist upward in the soft green-yellow light of the crystal globes.  Underfoot, the dock is decorated with swirling patterns of coral, shell, and gold.  Neatly stacked in rows are boxes and bales of cargo.  Rising on the hill with the lights sparkling like gleaming gems in the night is the Merelew city, while gazing into the water more lights can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":"go gallaenia"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":120,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Gallaenia, Fore Deck","descriptions":["Deobar railings decorated with carved dolphins separate the polished ebonwood deck from the sea.  Rising from the central cabin is the ship's tall ironwood mast, standing with sails furled.  Access aft is provided by a pair of narrow walkways leading around the cabin, while a locked deobar gate blocks further forward progress.  A lone Halfling crewman works to apply a new coat of oil and wax to the deck."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":6,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go merelew docks"}],"aliases":["Gallaenia"]},
  {"id":5,"x":120,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"The Gallaenia, Aft Deck","descriptions":["Carved deobar railings decorated with leaping dolphins line the deck.  Overhead an awning provides shelter for the crew to relax under.  The captain, who is sitting in an ebonwood chair inlaid with bits of shell and carved with flowers, watches five of the Halfling crew play a game of cards.  Hanging from the ship's wheel is a wine flask.  Forward access is provided by two walkways that lead around the main cabin.  The sound of waves provides a contrast to the calls of the crewmen."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":140,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Gallaenia, Main Lounge","descriptions":["The silverwood wall panels are covered in fine sea foam-colored silks.  Around the room are couches decorated with carved motifs of shells, and covered in dark blue brocade.  Cedar tables, with chairs of ebonwood inlaid with bits of shell and covered in leather, are available for people to meet take up much of the remaining space.  The silver candleholders are all shaped like deobar trees."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood door"},{"to":4,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":140,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"The Gallaenia, Purser's Office","descriptions":["A large maple desk decorated with carved yaks and inlaid with the seal of the Zoluren Traders' Guild fills the office.  Seated at the desk, the purser is sorting notes into the pigeonholes.  Through the door of the next room can be seen Moon Mages holding open a moongate."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["bank","teller"]},
  {"id":8,"x":100,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Upper Dock","descriptions":["Traffic swirls in busy patterns across the dock as merchants, Merelew, and guests all meet here.  To one side sits the Customs Inspector's booth, closed for the festival.  To the north, a large building with onion-shaped domes rises over the city.","Soft green-yellow light falls across the limestone and coral dock.  Crates, bales, boxes, and assorted cargo stand in quiet rows waiting for the dawn.  A coral booth stands to one side, silent and empty.  To the north, lights glitter and sparkle, while the sound of music drifts on the night breeze."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":3,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":"go guardhouse"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":80,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Guardhouse","descriptions":["Amid the warm glow of brass oil dish lamps, several gray-scaled guards in green uniforms inspect dossiers and polish and sharpen their weapons.  Maces and scimitars line the walls, along with multi-colored decorations for heroism.  A few also write reports, inspect cabinets for merchandise, and study a roster on the wall.  A Merelew guard captain looks on quietly, taking in all the activity without comment."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy door"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":80,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, West Dock","descriptions":["Cargo stands in neat array on the smooth limestone slabs of the dock.  Overhead, an awning made from woven, ornamental rugs stretches between pillars of coral, providing a measure of shelter.  Hovering among the stacks of merchandise, a Merelew merchant in green silks and an Elf in blue brocade bargain over an open box of pearls.","The cargo stacked in orderly rows makes comfortable nooks and crannies to sit and view the Merelew city sparkling like a jewel in the dark.  Soft green-yellow light comes from crystal globes on the coral pillars."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":100,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Palace Road","descriptions":["The sandstone paving contrasts with the patterns of interlocking spirals made from coral, shells, platinum, and gold set into the road.  Low buildings of sandstone, decorated with coral and pearlescent shell panels, alternate with tall coral pillars along the route.  A basalt statue faces a marble statue across the way, the icons mostly ignored as passersby stroll north toward the Palace domes or south to the docks.","The soft green-yellow light reveals two statues on either side of the road.  Low buildings line the way, a cool ocean breeze sighing around them."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":12,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":102,"exit":"go","move":"go hillside path"},{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go cream-colored building"},{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood shed"},{"to":141,"exit":"go","move":"go jacquard tent"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":80,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Palace Road","descriptions":["The sandstone road curves up the hill from the docks towards the Palace, avoiding a large coral garden edged with a low wall.  Both the wall and the road have been decorated with coral, shells, platinum, and gold set in abstract patterns, and coral pillars stand at intervals along the route.  A pair of statues frames the garden, across from a coral bench.","The road curves up the hill from the docks and goes around a coral garden.  Green-yellow light from the hanging globes illuminates twin statues and pillars along the edge, where a low wall prevents casual visitors from wandering into the garden."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":11,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":"go garden gate"},{"to":317,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone bookstore"},{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go red tent"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":100,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Palace Road","descriptions":["The onion-shaped domes of the palace rise over the coral and sandstone archway that stands astride the terminus of the road.  Standing before the archway is a coral tree, shaped like a great deobar.  Under the branches are benches for people to stop and rest.  On both sides are fountains of sandstone decorated with coral.  The sounds of the water gurgling in the fountains and of the wind blowing through the tree can be heard.","The road ends at a sandstone and coral archway.  Soft green-yellow light shed from crystal globes illuminates a coral tree in the middle of the road.  The relaxing sound of water comes from fountains that edge the roadway.  Underfoot, the sandstone road is inset with square patterns of shell and coral, highlighted with platinum and gold."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":122,"exit":"go","move":"go sandalwood caravans"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Pishuna"]},
  {"id":14,"x":60,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["A low gate in the wall allows access to the garden which is lined with paths and neat beds of coral.  Bright red rocks set out the edges of the plantings, their irregular outlines adding a pleasing note of informality to the setting.  Benches along the pathways allow for passersby to stop and admire the garden."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":15,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"aliases":["sharks","brine sharks"]},
  {"id":15,"x":40,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["A trellis supports some delicate coral formations that climb along the walls of the garden.  Nearby, a large stone bench is encrusted with some sort of relative of oysters, but not one normally encountered above the waves."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":20,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":19,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":18,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":17,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":40,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["Green coral rises from a bed, twisting into a spiral shape that reaches for the heavens.  Lower growths of coral grow in some other beds in this corner of the walled garden."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":18,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":17,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":20,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["Winding paths of crushed sandstone run between the neatly tended coral beds.  Stone benches are scattered about, allowing for the residents to take their rest in the peaceful environs of the garden."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":15,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":18,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":20,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["A lone statue stands in the middle of the garden, its features so worn from the passage of time that it resembles a large rock more than a humanoid figure.  Sculpted coral grows around it, carefully tended and cared for by the hordes of gardeners."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":16,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":20,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":20,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["This corner of the garden is full of twisted corals in a multitude of colors, all of them intertwined into a mass that dominates the area.  A few tendrils have escaped the borders of the garden beds and reach out into the pathways."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":15,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":20,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":40,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Coral Garden","descriptions":["Paths snake between the tidy beds of coral, lined with red rocks and carefully raked clear of debris.  The tall pink spires of coral twist overhead, forming arches and spans."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":19,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":18,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":220,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, East Dock","descriptions":["Across the dock all is in disarray, as merchants open crates and boxes, sorting out their cargos.  Busy Merelew carry boxes and bales along the shore, while others haul crates up from the water.  Their task is made more difficult by a couple of still unmended holes in the dock that are covered by sawhorses.","Neatly stacked crates line the dock, providing convenient access to the road.  Glowing crystal globes shed a soft green-yellow light across the dock, casting the coral into relief.  In the water, lights glitter, and the occasional ripple makes them dance.  A few holes in the dock are blocked off by sawhorses.","Across the dock all is in disarray, as merchants open crates and boxes, sorting out their cargos.  Busy Merelew carry boxes and bales along the shore, while others haul crates up from the water.  Their task is made more difficult a hole in the dock surrounded by sawhorses.","Neatly stacked crates line the dock, providing convenient access to the road.  Glowing crystal globes shed a soft green-yellow light across the dock, casting the coral into relief.  In the water, lights glitter, and the occasional ripple makes them dance.  A hole in the dock is surrounded by sawhorses."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":32,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":8,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":83,"exit":"go","move":"go dark alley"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":220,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Dock Walk","descriptions":["Crowds of eager visitors to the island file off the sandstone docks, which are decorated with shell and gold.  Some mill about in indecisiveness or awe, while others rush to see the fabled Andreshlew.  Kelp-covered pillars of limestone rise above the docks, thick ropes tied to them mooring visiting ships.  The road cuts a swath through the buildings of coral, leading to the heart of the city."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":23,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go colorful boutique"},{"to":144,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"},{"to":145,"exit":"go","move":"go cake-shaped shop"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["peddler"]},
  {"id":23,"x":180,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Dock Walk","descriptions":["A layer of pastel-shaded ocean shells is embedded in the brown sandstone roadway, creating a colorfully intricate mosaic of marine images.  Land dwellers teem over the roadway, though it shows no signs of wear, and many of them stop by the domed coral shops lining the street."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":24,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone building"},{"to":147,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"},{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go small emporium"},{"to":149,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden shack"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":140,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Dock Walk","descriptions":["The rainbow coral blends together with the many pennants and banners of mainlander merchants to create a gaudy display to dazzle the eyes.  The intersection is filled with the noises of buying and selling, as shoppers haggle over prices and hawkers call out all they have to offer.  Blue-scaled Merelew merge with outlanders to create a virtual impasse of people.  Merelew guards bearing tridents and spears guard the merchants and customers."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":25,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":94,"exit":"go","move":"go white pavilion"},{"to":150,"exit":"go","move":"go crimson tent"},{"to":151,"exit":"go","move":"go lofty shop"},{"to":152,"exit":"go","move":"go brick building"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":100,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Pearl Road","descriptions":["Alongside the sandstone street is a massive pearl-laced oyster filled with bright silk cushions to provide relaxation to the weary.  Opposite the massive oyster, a large sandstone sea turtle statue stands looking passively at passersby."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":24,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":153,"exit":"go","move":"go web-covered wagons"},{"to":156,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy tent"},{"to":157,"exit":"go","move":"go greenhouse"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":100,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Pearl Road","descriptions":["A wooden structure rises above the street, the seaweed-covered building clearly once part of a ship.  The hulk is rotted away in some places, but has mostly been refitted, and an oak sign proclaims that it is now used as an inn.  The smells of exotic foods fill the air from within.  Carved upon the side of the ship is one word, partially obscured through time: Dolefaren."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":25,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":138,"exit":"go","move":"go dolefaren"},{"to":158,"exit":"go","move":"go elegant shop"},{"to":160,"exit":"go","move":"go white building"},{"to":162,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow tent"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":140,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Pearl Road","descriptions":["Along the side of the road, a rugged coral promontory looks out over the blue depths of the bay.  Ships plow through the water, traveling to and from Andreshlew, as well as navigating to other locations.  On the far horizon can be seen the buildings of a city on the mainland.  Two gaping holes in the roadbed are blocked off by sawhorses.","Along the side of the road, a rugged coral promontory looks out over the blue depths of the bay.  Ships plow through the water, traveling to and from Andreshlew, as well as navigating to other locations.  On the far horizon can be seen the buildings of a city on the mainland.  A small hole in the roadbed is blocked off by sawhorses."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":163,"exit":"go","move":"go silver tent"},{"to":164,"exit":"go","move":"go cozy cottage"},{"to":165,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":180,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lithralia Street","descriptions":["Standing at the roadside is a sandstone and coral building, its granite facade carved with images of sea animals like dolphins, gulls, and sharks.  A cinquefoil arch of gold curves over the structure in a graceful sweep.  On the corner stand two gold statues of Merelew, one male and one female, the tips of their webbed hands touching above the roadway to form an arch."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":31,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":27,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":166,"exit":"go","move":"go whitewashed shed"},{"to":168,"exit":"go","move":"go boxy structure"},{"to":169,"exit":"go","move":"go cozy shop"},{"to":170,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden wagon"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":280,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lithralia Street","descriptions":["A group of Gor'Tog men work at unpacking a sizable stack of wooden crates filled with goods belonging to mainland traders.  The bustling area is filled with garish merchant displays meant to attract customers and loosen moneybelts."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":28,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":98,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone hall"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":280,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Shrine Walk","descriptions":["The peristyle courtyard adjoined to the shrine of Andreshlew is filled with sea anemone and bright red and blue coral.  The elaborate pearl colonnade is decorated with pictures of Merelew lore, depicting everything from animals to Eluned herself."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":31,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":96,"exit":"go","move":"go nearby shrine"},{"to":97,"exit":"go","move":"go gathering hall"},{"to":171,"exit":"go","move":"go snug cottage"},{"to":172,"exit":"go","move":"go cramped boutique"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":180,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Shrine Walk","descriptions":["A small shop of red coral rests beside a lantern pole, the building covered with a pearl dome in a minaret shape, draped in barnacles and anemone.  A lone column stands in the center of the road, covered in seaweed and providing shelter to the Merelew, unaccustomed to the dryness of the surface."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":30,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":24,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":95,"exit":"go","move":"go white-marbled pavilion"},{"to":173,"exit":"go","move":"go frost-covered shop"},{"to":174,"exit":"go","move":"go tapestry tent"},{"to":175,"exit":"go","move":"go gold temple"},{"to":402,"exit":"go","move":"go multi-roomed tent"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":300,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Sinuous Shore Road","descriptions":["Along the shore, the road is separated from the ocean by a low wall, which is dotted at intervals by pillars decorated with images of kraken.  A sandstone building topped by a low, onion-shaped dome stands on the northern side of the road, and more domes and towers rise across the water.","Softly lit by a green-yellow glow, the road winds along the shore, buffered from the ocean by a low wall dotted with pillars.  On the north side of the road stands a sandstone building.  Across and under the water glitters a spectacle of lights.  The lapping of the sea against the wall and the rushing of wind among the coral carry far in the quiet night."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":177,"exit":"go","move":"go white cottage"},{"to":180,"exit":"go","move":"go pine shop"},{"to":181,"exit":"go","move":"go flannel tent"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":320,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Sinuous Shore Road","descriptions":["On the west side of the road stands a wide building with an open courtyard.  In the courtyard a fountain carved with dolphins is visible.  The dolphin pattern is repeated on the building.  Opposite it a low wall blocks access to the ocean and pillars stand at intervals along it.","Soft, green-yellow light fills the courtyard of the building on the north side of the road.  Standing sentry at the water's edge, a low wall supported by pillars at intervals, is decorated with a profusion of dolphins sporting about."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":32,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go wide building"},{"to":182,"exit":"go","move":"go stucco cottage"},{"to":185,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood shop"},{"to":187,"exit":"go","move":"go stone crypt"},{"to":188,"exit":"go","move":"go domed hall"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":34,"x":340,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Sinuous Shore Road","descriptions":["Two walls line the road.  The seaside wall is low and easy to look over but the landside wall is unbroken except for a closed wooden gate.  A pair of guards stands before the gate to turn away non-Merelew.  At intervals along the low wall pillars stand sentinel carved like twining tentacles.","Walls rise up on both sides of the road.  The seaside wall is low and easy to see over.  In the landside wall a large gate is guarded by two Merelew.  Soft green-yellow light is shed from the globes on top of the pillars standing sentinel along the eastern wall."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":33,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go white gazebo"},{"to":195,"exit":"go","move":"go pink pavilion"},{"to":197,"exit":"go","move":"go clapboard emporium"},{"to":198,"exit":"go","move":"go rambling shop"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":400,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Sinuous Shore Road","descriptions":["The road stretches to a coral and sandstone archway flanked by two towers.  The northern tower is carved with dolphins, the southern with sharks, and the coral of the arch bridging the two is formed into a repeating pattern of flying albatrosses.","The road stretches through a coral and sandstone archway flanked by two towers.  The northern tower is carved with dolphins, the southern with sharks, and the coral of the arch bridging the two is formed into a repeating pattern of flying albatrosses.  White light gleams from crystal globes on the towers' corners, offsetting the softer green-yellow radiating from the globes on the pillars."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go coral archway"},{"to":205,"exit":"go","move":"go entrance"},{"to":82,"exit":"go","move":"go cramped shack"},{"to":207,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"},{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":400,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["This end of the lane is shaded by several aquamarine coral trees draped with silken strands of flutter moss.  They frame a small building made entirely from the horned carapace of some giant crustacean.  Its translucent walls shade from cream to scarlet.  A sign spans the round doorway, held in place by the creature's enormous claws."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go whitewashed cottage"},{"to":209,"exit":"go","move":"go colorful building"},{"to":210,"exit":"go","move":"go tall shop"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":320,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Lobby","descriptions":["Creamy white marble walls streaked with blue surround the spacious entry hall of Andreshlew's premier artisans' center.  Underfoot, a tile floor surrounds a central mosaic which depicts the creation of the Merelew by Lemicus."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":38,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["gift","Mishli"]},
  {"id":38,"x":300,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Registrar's Office","descriptions":["High arched windows let sunlight stream in, bathing the creamy blue-streaked marble walls in a soft glow.  Standing behind a long marble counter and flanked by enormous filing cabinets, meticulously dressed clerks attend to incoming paperwork."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":"go coralite curtain"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":280,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Item Registration","descriptions":["Creamy white marble walls streaked with blue surround the large office space that is dedicated to the proper documentation of items.  Covered by stacks of forms and feather quills, a large alabaster desk dominates the room."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":"go coralite curtain"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Registration"]},
  {"id":40,"x":320,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Lounge","descriptions":["High arched windows let sunlight stream in, bathing the creamy blue-streaked marble walls in a soft glow.  Around the edge of the room close to a long glass table, wooden chairs are arranged in conversational groupings, their polished surface releasing a subtle fragrance of humble beeswax and the sharper tang of lemon.  Heavy mesh curtains in platinum, gold, silver, bronze, and copper lead to different workrooms.","High arched windows let air in, and candles bathe the creamy blue-streaked marble walls in a soft glow.  Around the edge of the room close to a long glass table, wooden chairs are arranged in conversational groupings, their polished surface releasing a subtle fragrance of humble beeswax and the sharper tang of lemon.  Heavy mesh curtains in platinum, gold, silver, bronze, and copper lead to different workrooms."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":132,"exit":"go","move":"go platinum curtain"},{"to":133,"exit":"go","move":"go gold curtain"},{"to":134,"exit":"go","move":"go silver curtain"},{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze curtain"},{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go copper curtain"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["alteration","lounge"]},
  {"id":41,"x":320,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["Eleven oversized marble statues of heralds line both sides of the lane.  Made of white marble luxuriantly veined with gold, each stands poised with one leg thrust forward, a long-stemmed trumpet at its lips.  Tattered but colorful banners of long-vanished aristocratic houses flap proudly as they hang from the instruments.  Where a twelfth statue once stood is now a huge splinter of metal amidst a pile of marble chips."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":47,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":48,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":211,"exit":"go","move":"go white shop"},{"to":213,"exit":"go","move":"go black hall"},{"to":218,"exit":"go","move":"go brick emporium"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":320,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Suporni Tomerszentani","descriptions":["A pair of garden beds, sunk deep in murky salt water, outline this twisty lane.  Each contains dozens of spare green spider ferns.  Their delicate, weblike leaves are bedecked with the watery jewels of misted spray.  An occasional snail crawls slowly through the branches, housed in a large shell covered with flowering yellow air blossoms."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":43,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":247,"exit":"go","move":"go enclosed gazebo"},{"to":249,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas pavilion"},{"to":250,"exit":"go","move":"go brick building"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":280,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Suporni Tomerszentani","descriptions":["Water-sodden areas to either side of the walkway are occupied by hundreds of cream-colored cowry shells bearing slender brown twigs.  Most are covered with red, trumpet-like blossoms.  An immense tree trunk, once oak, now driftwood, maintains a central spot in the lane.  Carved with arabesqued depictions of Dwarves battling forest-sized monsters, it has been covered with a lattice of copper designed to resemble stitched branches."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":243,"exit":"go","move":"go rustic building"},{"to":244,"exit":"go","move":"go oak wagon"},{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":280,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Suporni Tomerszentani","descriptions":["Saltwater garden patches irrigated from somewhere out of view dot this region.  Each is home to a mixture of blue corals, white and black lotus pads, and delicate tufts of golden seaweave grass.  A couple of Merelew gardeners slosh their webbed feet through the heavy, wet sand, gently pruning and occasionally crooning in high, twittering tones to the life they tend."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":43,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":239,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden bungalow"},{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go elegant boutique"},{"to":241,"exit":"go","move":"go apple-red tent"},{"to":242,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood shack"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":320,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Suporni Tomerszentani","descriptions":["Watery beds of blue, campanular flowers surround a fluted alabaster fountain of heroic proportions.  Depicting some sort of meeting between River Elves and S'Kra Mur, it is carved to size, with nearly a dozen figures encompassed by churning waves and surging sea foam.  The circular base of the fountain is nearly as large and covered by writing in a cursive script.  It is apparently hollow, judging by the round doorway which is propped open."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":44,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":237,"exit":"go","move":"go silk pavilion"},{"to":238,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy shed"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":460,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Suporni Tomerszentani","descriptions":["A swale of sandy turf envelops the meandering lane.  Tussocks of seaweave grass display a wavering golden carpet, bordered by pink coral coaxed and nurtured into various animal shapes.  Dolphins bound, seahorses gallop.  Sea crabs extend rocky pincers forever above their shells.  A school of sculpted flounders loops a fanciful circle around a salmon-colored whale."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":45,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":81,"exit":"go","move":"go pebbled path"},{"to":225,"exit":"go","move":"go large hall"},{"to":226,"exit":"go","move":"go cozy bungalow"},{"to":227,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden chuckwagon"},{"to":228,"exit":"go","move":"go tapestry tent"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":380,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["The lane continues between two well-irrigated rows of luxurious purple mintweed.  Bristling like a head of thick Dwarven hair, the plant responds to the ministrations of several Merelew gardeners with a sweetly pungent scent.  In the middle of the area stands a brass gazebo with moss-green jade walls.  The unmistakable sound of clinking coins emerges from within, along with voices raised in occasional argument."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":219,"exit":"go","move":"go rustic cabana"},{"to":222,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas booth"},{"to":224,"exit":"go","move":"go brick boutique"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":200,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["A squat structure supporting a low, hemispherical cupola occupies the space to the north of the lane, opposite a massive copper bell.  The building is composed of bricks made from compressed shells, mortared with bright yellow amber."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":53,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":79,"exit":"go","move":"go otter den"},{"to":251,"exit":"go","move":"go elegant emporium"},{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":200,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["The road slopes through a well-shaded region covered with massive blue and red lichen patches.  Their heavy growths have been carefully trimmed into broad, conical shapes, inset with pale glowstones.  The lichen bushes stir slightly, perpetually undulating from side to side, although no breath of air stirs within the area.  Beneath several specimens lies an eight-sided doorway leading into the earth, outlined in irregular glowstones that slowly shift between darkness and an angry red glare."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":48,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":267,"exit":"go","move":"go dark caravan"},{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"},{"to":271,"exit":"go","move":"go half-timbered shop"}],"color":"#FF00FF"},
  {"id":50,"x":200,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["A granite rampart rises almost vertically, its few jagged, rocky outcroppings occupied by nests built from salvaged seaweed.  Large grey birds swoop down to grab speckled tortoises as they cross the road, dropping them from on high to crack open their shells.  The splattered remains are carried aloft to hungry chicks that are hidden from sight, but very audible."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":51,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":67,"exit":"go","move":"go cavern opening"},{"to":272,"exit":"go","move":"go black hut"},{"to":273,"exit":"go","move":"go makeshift wagon"},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go grey building"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":200,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Saphtinagi","descriptions":["This sonorous cavern is lit by a flickering set of pale white globes, each securely held in a brass wall mount shaped like a taloned fist.  Gleaming, uncut sapphires protrude from every rocky surface.  Their gentian lustre invokes a moonless sky, when looking up at midnight is to risk falling into the soothing darkness.  A small crescent-shaped building made of translucent white crystal stands silent and majestic among the sea of gems."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":50,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":73,"exit":"go","move":"go side passage"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["undertaker","Grichye"]},
  {"id":52,"x":200,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Rubtanagi","descriptions":["Granite and iron ore have been chipped away from the walls, revealing imbedded veins of rubies in their natural, uncut state.  They vary in shade from the rose pink of Halfling gardens to the deep red of Elothean vinegar wine, to the magenta interlaced with black known as Teiro's Hate.  An oversized, reinforced brass door, recessed in one wall, is barred and shut beneath a guttering torch."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":51,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Wierge"]},
  {"id":53,"x":60,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["Two walls of black granite latticework line the lane above massive blue sandbanks.  From behind the walls stare small, green-skinned children, waving webbed fingers, squealing and giggling.  Occasionally a child throws down a colorful, spinning, silver-winged toy at the heads of passersby, only to have it recoil swiftly into the hands of its owner before it hits."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":54,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":254,"exit":"go","move":"go steel-banded wagon"},{"to":261,"exit":"go","move":"go velvet tent"},{"to":262,"exit":"go","move":"go brick building"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":40,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Falashtan","descriptions":["The end of the lane is marked by a pitted, rust-colored obelisk made from some unknown creature's tusk.  An octagonal building stands alongside it, raised on top of eight short, marble columns.  The building is covered with blue floral mosaics imbedded within a golden background, and surmounted by a ribbed octagonal copper minaret that curves on high to a hooked tip.  From that hook depends a swinging bronze plaque."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":129,"exit":"go","move":"go entrance"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go souvenir shop"},{"to":264,"exit":"go","move":"go ramshackle tavern"},{"to":265,"exit":"go","move":"go dilapidated stall"},{"to":266,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden stall"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":200,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Raldtanagi","descriptions":["Emerald ore sparkles everywhere in this cavern: a dark, rich green that resembles the leaves of an oak at dusk's descent.  A pair of sputtering oil lamps provide dim illumination -- just enough to see a modest lean-to in one corner, built from slabs of quartz.  The structure appears weak enough to collapse with a strong sigh, but sounds of activity from inside prove otherwise."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":52,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["fortuneteller"]},
  {"id":56,"x":-60,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Suporni Kavmalitan","descriptions":["A raised circular platform of fossilized bone marks the center of a giant starfish.  Five spacious, symmetrical arms radiate outwards, their surfaces smoothed into walkways.  Far to the north is a golden pavilion.  To the northeast is a blue tower made of several large spheres resting on top of one another.  The northwest arm leads to a smashed seacraft's hull.  A purple spire flying a scarlet flag lies further along the southwest arm, while the southeast one leads to a spiral minaret of black stone."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":61,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":57,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":63,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":59,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Drogor shrine","animal shrine","critter"]},
  {"id":57,"x":-20,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Vargsavo Utrem","descriptions":["Large, twisted trunks and branches of brown coral flank both sides of the walkway.  Artfully covered with green flutter moss, they give the impression of living trees.  Jewel-like beetles fly lazily among the structures, seeking shelter in the myriad holes.  When settled they glance out, blinking surprisingly large, multifaceted sapphire eyes."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":280,"exit":"go","move":"go garish caravan"},{"to":283,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood tavern"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Vargsavo Utrem","descriptions":["A giant, windowless spiral minaret of gleaming black brick rises over twenty feet in height.  In the center at its broad base is a reinforced bone archway, pointed with the grinning, bleached skull of a ram.  Within the archway is a recessed darkness unlit by any hint of movement or life.  A staircase snakes along the outside rim up to a flat rooftop."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":131,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":284,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"},{"to":309,"exit":"go","move":"go structure"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":-100,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Bejana Utrem","descriptions":["An abandoned handcart sits in the middle of this starfish walkway.  Its clamshell sales counter is empty.  One of its two oaken wheels lies broken off in the street and spinning freely.  A sign sits alongside it, defaced but still readable."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":60,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":297,"exit":"go","move":"go grey pavilion"},{"to":298,"exit":"go","move":"go felt yurt"},{"to":299,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany caravan"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":-140,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Bejana Utrem","descriptions":["The partially decomposed hull of a shipwreck covers much of this area, its prow sunk deep in the porous but unyielding starfish exoskeleton.  Splintered masts and yards lean drunkenly upon the deck.  Flashes of sea breeze send the chipped side rudder and fragments of grey canvas flapping wildly.  An irregular doorway has been cut through the moss-enveloped hull next to a porthole."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":300,"exit":"go","move":"go white pavilion"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden cabana"},{"to":307,"exit":"go","move":"go white hut"},{"to":308,"exit":"go","move":"go oval hut"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":-20,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Bejasavo Utrem","descriptions":["Blue sandstone warehouses jostle one another on both sides of the starfish walkway.  Each features screened dome windows made of stucco, and decorated with cinquefoil tracery.  Friezes of rosettes run along the top of the walls, and surround the closed jalousies and gates of bolted copper.  One particular warehouse, slightly larger than the others, lies open.","Blue sandstone warehouses jostle one another on both sides of the starfish walkway.  Each features screened dome windows made of stucco, and decorated with cinquefoil tracery.  Friezes of rosettes run along the top of the walls, and surround the closed jalousies and gates of bolted copper."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":275,"exit":"go","move":"go cozy shop"},{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go simple wagon"},{"to":277,"exit":"go","move":"go suede tent"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":20,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Bejasavo Utrem","descriptions":["Three enormous blue alexandrite spheres of diminishing size rest on top of one another, forming a bulbous tower.  At close range it displays partially eroded vine and scroll arabesques chiseled into every inch of stone.  A corroded iron banner displaying a seven-rayed star squeaks as it swings on a ceremonial spear attached to the second sphere."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go fish-shaped tent"},{"to":279,"exit":"go","move":"go painted cottage"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":-100,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Vargna Utrem","descriptions":["The walkway is lined with a plentiful supply of granite chips, covered with glowing yellow algae.  Several sawhorses protect pedestrians from falling into a large gaping hole in the walkway.  Glimmering, golden-winged insects buzz about them, humming softly and exuding a slight scent of myrrh.  Andreshlew traders and officials stop in their rounds to admire them, breathing in the heavy air with evident delight.  Further to the southwest is a purple-domed spire, while a raised platform lies to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":64,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":291,"exit":"go","move":"go red barn"},{"to":292,"exit":"go","move":"go brick store"},{"to":293,"exit":"go","move":"go grey tent"},{"to":294,"exit":"go","move":"go tall shop"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":-140,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Vargna Utrem","descriptions":["A curved spire constructed entirely from violet cinnabar dominates this arm of the starfish.  It has been carved into an endless, vermicular relief of stylized claws and dragons' heads.  Mummified arms and hands, swathed in indigo gauze, frame a diamond-shaped doorway.  A single lambent ruby occupies its summit, set in a wattled circular brass frame that resembles an eye.  Wide and round at its base and entryway, the spire swiftly narrows into a single, slender support that reaches for the sky."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":295,"exit":"go","move":"go stone building"},{"to":296,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar-trimmed bungalow"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":-60,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Beja Utrem","descriptions":["A bronze open-air lantern sways gently at the end of a long chain attached to a pole, in this otherwise featureless section of walkway, sea, and expansive sky.  Its oblong dish is filled with an aromatic, cinnamon-colored oil, over which a purple flame dances with abandon.  The pole is made of pink alabaster, carved to resemble three youthful tree trunks entwined into a single column.  The chain is also alabaster, each link carved intact, embracing its neighbors."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":56,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":313,"exit":"go","move":"go oilcloth tent"},{"to":314,"exit":"go","move":"go brocade tent"},{"to":315,"exit":"go","move":"go stately shop"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":-60,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Suporni Kavmalitan, Beja Utrem","descriptions":["At the end of this starfish arm sits a small rectangular pavilion resembling an oversized jewel box.  Its surface is inlaid with turquoise tilework, creating a massive curved eighteen-point star against a rich gold background.  False pillars with entwined vines festoon the corners.  They are covered in heavily dripping clusters of red grapes, made from embedded ruby chips."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":49,"exit":"none","move":"script hollowevevine","hidden":true}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["vine","catnip"]},
  {"id":67,"x":180,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cavern","descriptions":["Granite walls rise from the sandy floor of the cavern, the walls slick with seaweed and barnacles.  A few small puddles remain from when the island rose above the waves."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go cavern opening"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":180,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cavern","descriptions":["Narrow walls enclose the passage that delves into the granite of the seafloor.  Puddles hold a few scuttling creatures desperate for the ocean to return."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":69,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":115,"exit":"go","move":"go cave opening"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":180,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cavern","descriptions":["Granite layers give way to darker rocks as the passageway drills deeper into the ground, allowing access to caverns and grottos that are normally underwater.  A few bioluminescent plants cling to the walls, shedding a wan light in the area."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":70,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":160,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lava Tube","descriptions":["A tube that once held lava intersects with the downward passageway, cutting off further delving downward but opening up exploration of the lava tube."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":69,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":71,"x":140,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lava Tube","descriptions":["Twisting passages interweave in a complex dance of openings and obsidian walls.  Sand has been deposited on the floor, a reminder that this area is usually deep under the ocean."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":72,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":120,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lava Tube","descriptions":["The lava tube ends at a large plug of basalt, the leading edge of a lava flow that solidified in place.  Sand has drifted against the plug, more evidence of the usual undersea nature of these passages."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":220,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Tunnel, Entrance","descriptions":["Just within the entrance, a diffused light filters through the quartz walls to bathe the tunnel in a subdued glow.  The path slopes down from here, bending out of sight after a short distance.  A muted roar of rushing water echoes about the passage."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":51,"exit":"go","move":"go tunnel opening"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":240,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Tunnel, Sloping Passage","descriptions":["The slope of the tunnel lessens to a shallow gradient, making it hard to tell if it slopes up or down at this point.  Veins of crystal sparkle against the dark basalt walls, casting faint lights dancing about the dimly lit passage.  A deep roar of rushing water someplace in the distance makes the path vibrate beneath your feet."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":73,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":260,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Tunnel, Overlook","descriptions":["A narrow ledge overlooks a huge crystalline cavern deep within the island.  Water tumbles noisily through a high opening, falling about fifty feet into a shimmering pool below."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":74,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":280,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Tunnel, Moldy Passage","descriptions":["Slimy, rope-like roots cling to the walls of the passage to the north, covered by spongy mounds of damp mold.  The passage slopes sharply up, making travel difficult as feet go flying on the slippery surface of the tunnel.  Rushing water echoes about, the sound coming from a path which leads down into the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":75,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":78,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":280,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Crystal Cavern","descriptions":["This ceiling of this expansive cavern soars twenty feet overhead.  While not as large as the one visible from the ledge, it is no less spectacular.  The light from torches attached to the wall causes multihued sparkles to dance off large crystals and gemstones imbedded in the walls and ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":127,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["races","tunnel races"]},
  {"id":78,"x":280,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Underground Caverns, Quiet Lake","descriptions":["Water gushes out of an opening in the cave wall overhead, falling about fifty feet into a chilly underground lake.  The cavern sparkles as light plays off the water and the tiny crystals imbedded its walls.  A steep winding pathway leads upward to the north."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":79,"x":220,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Sea Otter Smash, Den","descriptions":["Colorful chalk murals of sea otters foraging for clams, sea urchins, and other crustaceans cover the craggy walls."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":"go hole"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Sea Otter Smash","Otter Smash","Otters","Shells"]},
  {"id":80,"x":240,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Sea Otter Smash, Sandy Shoal","descriptions":["Designed to imitate a sandy shoal off of a rocky coast, the walls are painted in blues and greens with wavy white lines to create a backdrop of undulating waves.  The fake marine room features a waterproof flooring covered in sand, and is filled with waist-deep water."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":81,"x":460,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Stupid Terrestrian Tricks, Stands","descriptions":["From this small amphitheater the stage is visible in its entirety, as is the registration booth and the waiting area.  Wooden bleachers have been provided for the audience's comfort, and the crowd has taken advantage of them."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"go","move":"go waiting area"},{"to":114,"exit":"go","move":"go registration booth"},{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go pebbled path"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":420,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Bobbing for Lamprey","descriptions":["Light creeping in from beyond the flap casts streaks of illumination across the room."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go leather flap"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["lampreys","bobbing"]},
  {"id":83,"x":200,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Dark Alley","descriptions":["Poised at the end of an alley, an enormous crimson dragon lies, jaws agape, ready to snap up passersby.  Deep inside the fearsome beast's throat a silver door shimmers, dispelling the illusion and revealing it as the elaborate facade of some festival entertainment."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":"go east dock"},{"to":84,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":84,"x":200,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Crimson Dragon Gaming, Entry Hall","descriptions":["Woven garlands of kelp decorated with pristine white waterlilies sharply contrast with the crimson walls of the entryway.  Driftwood arches lead off to the various gaming rooms and a stairway carved of sandstone spirals downward into the gullet of the dragon."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":86,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":83,"exit":"go","move":"go silver door"},{"to":87,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone staircase"}],"aliases":["bingo"]},
  {"id":85,"x":220,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Crimson Dragon Gaming, Swordsman's Hall","descriptions":["Smoky torches create a faint bluish haze in the air of this long hall.  Coarse benches provide adequate seating for a legion of players.  Assorted weaponry decorates the walls, presumably tools to slay the dragon of gaming lore."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Swordsman's Hall"]},
  {"id":86,"x":180,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Crimson Dragon Gaming, Lily Room","descriptions":["Softly glowing gaethzen spheres are suspended from delicate silver chains about the room and highlight a central pond, nearly covered in bright lush waterlilies.  A smooth driftwood table, holding a supply of gaming materials, stands toward one end of the room near the caller."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Lily Room"]},
  {"id":87,"x":180,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Crimson Dragon Gaming, Sea Chamber","descriptions":["Crystal columns form a semicircle about a wall of glass that stretches along one side of the room and looks directly into the sea beneath the island.  Schools of tiny phosphorescent fish dance and dart within the columns, creating shifting patterns of light throughout the chamber.  The caller stands before the backdrop of ocean life that thrives a few feet away."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone staircase"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Sea Chamber"]},
  {"id":88,"x":200,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Seat of Unification, Lobby","descriptions":["A hub of activity, this hexagonal room features each faction equally represented along a wall.  Merelew come and go, briefly stopping to talk with one another before passing through.  Like all transitory spaces, it is marked primarily by clean floors and passably comfortable furniture that appears largely unused.  Festive kelp linen banners hang from the ceiling, which is set with a swirling pattern of blue-hued stones."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"go","move":"go coral arch"},{"to":91,"exit":"go","move":"go metallic arch"},{"to":90,"exit":"go","move":"go living arch"},{"to":92,"exit":"go","move":"go elaborate arch"},{"to":93,"exit":"go","move":"go simple arch"},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":"go columned exit"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["faction","faction lounge"]},
  {"id":89,"x":220,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Lounge, Depth Shapers","descriptions":["Half completed sculptures and murals are arranged around the room, as Merelew dressed in functional work robes mill about.  While the most common medium is flowing shell and coral, stone, tapestry, and the occasional glint of gem or metal are also incorporated into the designs.  Some of the Merelew are busy working on projects, others passionately debating technique or expression.  Visible is a wide range of artistic representation, from the abstract and symbolic to exquisite detail and lifelike forms.  Scattered throughout the room are various imported artworks from the mainland, meticulously cared for and prominently displayed.  Etched into the far wall is an oval line."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go coral arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Depth Shapers"]},
  {"id":90,"x":180,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Lounge, Trickling Sun","descriptions":["Every surface is covered in life, ocean and air breathing represented in equal part. Thick vines cover the walls, tall cylindrical tanks hold schooling fish and stretching kelp, and open basins feature mussel covered rocks regularly misted with brine rising around open pools full of anemone, coral, crab and darting octopus. Several Merelew tend to the room, softly chiding uncooperative flora and fauna and praising new growth. A large stone platform at the center of the room displays a small piece of tomiek sealed in thick lead glass, and on the far wall, a large oval door is secured with thick kelp fiber ropes."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go living arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Trickling Sun"]},
  {"id":91,"x":180,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Lounge, Inverted Crucible","descriptions":["The air reeks of chemicals, sour acids and bitter bases, the stench of sulfur and the yeasty tang of fermenting kelp. The sound of hammering and roaring fires can be heard echoing deeper into the building. A number of plain tables and benches line the walls, stockpiles of materials carefully sorted along shelves. One wall is clean slate, interrupted by regularly mounted cups holding dense chalk in various colors. The slate is covered in incomplete diagrams, sketched ideas, and mathematical or chemical formulae. On the far wall, a large oval door is secured with thick bands of shimmering steel."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go metallic arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Inverted Crucible"]},
  {"id":92,"x":220,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Lounge, Red Fan Traders","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go elaboratecoral arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Red Fan Traders"]},
  {"id":93,"x":200,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Lounge, Supplicants of the Tide","descriptions":["An expansive limestone dome arcs high overhead, removed sections in a trifold symmetrical pattern forming a large skylight. The acoustics of the room are incredible -- there is no echo, but all sound is amplified. Flawlessly polished sapphire and quartz prisms hang from fine seasilk lines, gently swaying in errant breezes and casting dancing rainbows and spears of light along every surface. At the center of the room sits a softly smiling statue of Aluna, arms outstretched and webbed hands splayed wide. Numerous Merelew in simple robes gaze upward or at the figure in reflection, attending to the questions of guests in muted conversation. On the far wall there is a plain oval door secured with a thick basalt beam. "],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"go","move":"go simple arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Supplicants of the Tide"]},
  {"id":94,"x":140,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Limited Treasures, Lounge","descriptions":["Plush white carpet covers the floor from wall to wall, contrasting with the dark polished metal that creates them.  A pair of overstuffed black chairs sit to either side of a long charcoal-hued couch covered in throw pillows.  More pillows of various colors are scattered upon the floor giving customers a choice for seating.  A silversteel door stands across the room from another door ominously curtained with deathfiber."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go silversteel door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Limited Treasures","Gortik","LT"]},
  {"id":95,"x":140,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew's Grand Raffle","descriptions":["Like a pebble dropped into a pond, concentric circles of blue and white tile spread forth from the heart of a wide pavilion.  The epicenter of the glistening wave is a white-marbled domed roof covering a small counter."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go exit"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Raffles"]},
  {"id":96,"x":260,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Holy Shrine","descriptions":["Andreshlew's holy shrine, surrounded by its arching peristyle of pearl, contains an elaborate marble altar in the center of a colorful coral garden.  The garden, filled with coral sculptures of animals and rainbow anemone, is broken by paths leading to the altar, upon which is a finely polished gold statue of a Merelew male."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["shrine","Holy Shrine"]},
  {"id":97,"x":300,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Gathering Hall","descriptions":["High overhead large beams support the roof of this airy structure.  Cozy nooks and seating arrangements are scattered about, allowing visitors to the island to relax and unwind before braving the outside once more.  Colorful rugs cover the polished stone flagstones of the floor."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":"go exit door"}],"aliases":["Gathering Hall"]},
  {"id":98,"x":280,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Gaming Hall, Crown and Anchor Venue","descriptions":["Pale pink flagstones offset the deeper hued sandstone walls of the Crown and Anchor venue.  Oversized glass-paned storm lanterns hang from the vaulted ceiling and cast bright pools of light, creating a feeling of eternal day.  No windows are present to spoil the illusion of timelessness for the gaming enthusiasts.  Occasional loud cheers or anguished groans escape from behind the thick velvet curtains that seperate the gaming tables from the hall entrance."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"go","move":"go velvet curtain"},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":"go coral archway"}],"aliases":["Crown and Anchor"]},
  {"id":99,"x":260,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Crown and Anchor, High Roller Table","descriptions":["Reflecting the shape of the table, the room is a little longer than it is wide.  Pale green tapestries line the walls keeping the noise somewhat muted and giving the strong impression of an underwater cavern.  Three sides of the table are open for players and observers to gather around while the fourth is blocked off by portable railings allowing the libik - the table master - plenty of room to oversee the game."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"go","move":"go venue"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["High Roller Table"]},
  {"id":100,"x":280,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Crown and Anchor, Table","descriptions":["Reflecting the shape of the table, the room is a little longer than it is wide.  Pale green tapestries line the walls keeping the noise somewhat muted and giving the strong impression of an underwater cavern.  Three sides of the table are open for players and observers to gather around while the fourth is blocked off by portable railings allowing the libik - the table master - plenty of room to oversee the game."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"go","move":"go venue"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":101,"x":300,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Crown and Anchor, Table","descriptions":["Reflecting the shape of the table, the room is a little longer than it is wide.  Pale green tapestries line the walls keeping the noise somewhat muted and giving the strong impression of an underwater cavern.  Three sides of the table are open for players and observers to gather around while the fourth is blocked off by portable railings allowing the libik - the table master - plenty of room to oversee the game."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"go","move":"go venue"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":102,"x":60,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Path","descriptions":["Winding along the hillside, the gravel path twists among some coral trees as it works its way upwards towards a grove of kelp and coral."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go winding path"},{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"go cave opening"}]},
  {"id":103,"x":40,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Path","descriptions":["Short strands of seaweed cover the hillside, taking the place of the grass that normally would be there for places that are not underwater most of the time.  Neatly maintained, the gravel path works its way up the hillside towards a grove of kelp and coral."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":104,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":104,"x":20,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Path","descriptions":["A three-way intersection of the gravel path clings to the hillside.  One way leads further up the hill, another goes to a grove not far away, and the last heads back down towards the city lying below."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":105,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":107,"exit":"go","move":"go coral grove"}]},
  {"id":105,"x":0,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Path","descriptions":["Rocky outcrops poke through the hillside, with the path working its way through the increasing numbers of boulders and rocks strewn in its course onwand.  The trail shows signs of poor maintenance, with spots of bare dirt showing through the gravel."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":106,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":106,"x":-20,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Path","descriptions":["The path ends abruptly on the side of the hill, its cessation marked with a few abandoned tools and some piles of crushed rock.  A rotting barricade stands at the end of the path, blocking further passage up the hill."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":107,"x":0,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Grove","descriptions":["Towering coral pillars support limp kelp fronds while shorter seaweed varieties cover the ground under the tree-analogues.  Small puddles linger in the shade, remnants of the seawater that once covered the island."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":109,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":112,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":104,"exit":"go","move":"go hillside path"}],"aliases":["Cloud Eels","eels"]},
  {"id":108,"x":0,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Grove","descriptions":["Although Andreshlew lacks trees, the massive coral growths fill much the same niche in the ecology.  Normally these towering giants would be surrounded by salt water, but with the raising of the island, they stand proud in the air instead."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":109,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":112,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":109,"x":-20,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Grove","descriptions":["Confused seabirds flit through the coral spires, not understanding why their usual waves have been replaced with solid ground.  A few stands of seaweed hang down from the upper reaches of the coral, much like vines would in a terrestrial forest."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":107,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":108,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":110,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":111,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":-40,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Grove","descriptions":["Towering spires of coral meet overhead, much like a jungle canopy.  Long strands of kelp dangle from the spans aloft, their wide leaves limp in the unaccustomed air."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":112,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":111,"x":-40,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Grove","descriptions":["Thick growths of coral merge into the hillside, effectively cutting off travel further into the island.  A few larger clumps of seaweed struggle to stay alive while exposed to the surface."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":109,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":110,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":112,"x":-20,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Hillside Grove","descriptions":["Scraggly growths of seaweed cover the exposed seafloor, each clump limp and drooping as they struggle to make it through the time the island is above the waves.  Barnacles cling to the exposed rocks."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":108,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":110,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":111,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":113,"x":480,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Stupid Terrestrian Tricks, Waiting Area","descriptions":["This temporary, three-sided structure acts as a waiting area for contestants, and as a place for the Mongers' assistants to loiter.  Near a water trough, a number of the stage crew mill about holding clay steins and chatting.  Periodically one slips though the stage door and back out again, nodding to his compatriots."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"go","move":"go amphitheater"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":114,"x":460,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Stupid Terrestrian Tricks, Registration","descriptions":["Monger Pyr Od'Lolg sits on a stool behind a narrow countertop lording over the registration list and watching the goings on with a careful eye."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"go","move":"go amphitheater"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":115,"x":160,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["Walls eroded from water action, this cavern now stands empty of its creating force for a brief period.  Sand fills the crevices of the floor, while a few stray bits of seaweed lie forlornly about the area."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":116,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":119,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":68,"exit":"go","move":"go cave opening"}],"aliases":["undead merelew","decomposing merelew","lobsters","reefs","decapods","deadlight fish"]},
  {"id":116,"x":140,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["A few clumps of seaweed cling to the rocky walls, their leaves limply hanging down.  Poking up from the sandy floor is the ribcage of some undersea denizen, its bones encrusted with barnacles and shellfish."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":121,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":115,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":117,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":117,"x":120,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["Sheer granite walls rise from the sandy floor, polished by water action to an almost unnatural shine.  Nothing clings to the walls as there is no crack or crevice to give purchase."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":120,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":119,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":116,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":118,"x":120,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["The ceiling slopes down to meet the sandy floor, effectively cutting off movement in that direction.  A few bones lie scattered across the floor, although what animal they came from is impossible to determine."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":119,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":117,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":119,"x":140,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["The wide expanse of the cavern spreads out, the gloom hiding the walls from view.  Bits of flotsam litter the sandy floor, deposited there when the waters receded."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":121,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":115,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":116,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":117,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":118,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":120,"x":140,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["The smell of salt and the sea lingers here, drifting up from the pools of water that remain on the floor after the rising of the island.  A few drifts of sand make the footing on the cavern floor a bit treacherous."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":119,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":117,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":118,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":121,"x":160,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Cave","descriptions":["Coral spires reach from floor to ceiling, their sharp, spikey growth inhibiting travel in some directions.  Deep drifts of sand cover the cavern's floor."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":116,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":119,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":120,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":122,"x":120,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Owirvald Auction Company, Display Room","descriptions":["Rich sandalwood covers the interior walls of this spacious caravan, its high-polished sheen reflecting the light from the various brass lanterns hung about the room.  A pair of glass-topped display tables flank the opal-beaded curtain leading into the main hall."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":"go sandalwood door"},{"to":123,"exit":"go","move":"go opal-beaded curtain"}],"aliases":["auction"]},
  {"id":123,"x":140,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Owirvald Auction Company, Auction Floor","descriptions":["Rich sandalwood covers the interior walls of this spacious hall, its high-polished sheen reflecting the light from the various brass lanterns hung about the room.  Rows of leather-padded benches face the podium, offering a comfortable place to sit."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"go","move":"go opal-beaded curtain"},{"to":126,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":125,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":124,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["auction floor 1","auction 1"]},
  {"id":124,"x":120,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Owirvald Auction Company, Auction Floor","descriptions":["Rich sandalwood covers the interior walls of this spacious hall, its high-polished sheen reflecting the light from the various brass lanterns hung about the room.  Rows of leather-padded benches face the podium, offering a comfortable place to sit."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["auction floor 2","auction 2"]},
  {"id":125,"x":140,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Owirvald Auction Company, Auction Floor","descriptions":["Rich sandalwood covers the interior walls of this spacious hall, its high-polished sheen reflecting the light from the various brass lanterns hung about the room.  Rows of leather-padded benches face the podium, offering a comfortable place to sit."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["auction floor 3","auction 3"]},
  {"id":126,"x":160,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Owirvald Auction Company, Auction Floor","descriptions":["Rich sandalwood covers the interior walls of this spacious hall, its high-polished sheen reflecting the light from the various brass lanterns hung about the room.  Rows of leather-padded benches face the podium, offering a comfortable place to sit."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["auction floor 4","auction 4"]},
  {"id":127,"x":280,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Tunnel Races, Waiting Pool","descriptions":["This large wading pool appears to be fed by an underground stream.  The water is warm, possibly fed by hot springs.  Even in the shallow pool, the current is quite brisk, moving toward an opening in the north wall, where a metal gate is placed across the stream.  Apparently the starting gate is just one more room north."],"exits":[{"to":128,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":77,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":128,"x":280,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Tunnel Races, Starting Gate","descriptions":["You find yourself bobbing up and down in mid-stream, with others surrounding you doing the same.  You tread water, holding your position against the currents, as you wait for the starting signal."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":129,"x":20,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Great Sea Battle, Ticket Booth","descriptions":["Cool, humid air fills the area and droplets drape over everything in the area, living and inanimate.  Water pools in sunken areas showing all the places the ground is not exactly level.  A Merelew female stands in a booth to one side, her unblinking gaze sweeping the crowd for potential riders.  A brightly painted sign hangs above her head proclaiming, Tickets for sale!  People of all ages are gathered near another sign that contains further information on the ride."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":54,"exit":"go","move":"go exit"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Great Sea Battle"]},
  {"id":130,"x":20,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Great Sea Battle, Line","descriptions":["Coral barristers mark out the queue as it snakes around in a repeating pattern of rows.  It is an extremely efficient use of the space but in a busy day the wait could be a few anlaen long.  The floor here is wet from riders getting off soaked then running around to go on it again.  A quick glance up and over the line of people waiting shows the loading platform for the boats."],"exits":[{"to":129,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":131,"x":40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Minaret, Roof","descriptions":["A one-room hut of thin white bone squats on top of the brick roof.  Torchlight flickers through a series of lancet windows.  A horseshoe archway frames an entrance, outlined along its length by writing engraved in flowing gold foil calligraphy."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":132,"x":300,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Platinum Workroom","descriptions":["Bright sunlight and the scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide additional light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded platinum legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded platinum legs provides ample working space.","The scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide bright light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded platinum legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded platinum legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go platinum curtain"}],"aliases":["Platinum Workroom"]},
  {"id":133,"x":300,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Gold Workroom","descriptions":["Bright sunlight and the scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide additional light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded gold legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded gold legs provides ample working space.","The scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide bright light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded gold legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded gold legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go gold curtain"}],"aliases":["Gold Workroom"]},
  {"id":134,"x":320,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Silver Workroom","descriptions":["Bright sunlight and the scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide additional light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded silver legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded silver legs provides ample working space.","The scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide bright light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded silver legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded silver legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go silver curtain"}],"aliases":["Silver Workroom"]},
  {"id":135,"x":340,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Bronze Workroom","descriptions":["Bright sunlight and the scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide additional light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded bronze legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded bronze legs provides ample working space.","The scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide bright light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded bronze legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded bronze legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze curtain"}],"aliases":["Bronze Workroom"]},
  {"id":136,"x":340,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Saidakyp of Andreshlew, Copper Workroom","descriptions":["Bright sunlight and the scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide additional light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded copper legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded copper legs provides ample working space.","The scent of the ocean drifts in through high arched windows in the wall of the workroom, while gaethzen orbs hang in each corner to provide bright light.  Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded copper legs provides ample working space.","Placed to the side of the room, a large marble table with gilded copper legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"go","move":"go copper curtain"}],"aliases":["Copper Workroom"]},
  {"id":137,"x":340,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Don't Spill The Tea, Gazebo","descriptions":["Freshly painted beams create a spacious octagonal enclosure, leaving plenty of room between tea tables draped with pistachio cloths and high-backed chairs tied with peach bows.  Porcelain tea settings and three-tiered stands offer decadent fare to the patrons."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"go egress"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["tea"]},
  {"id":138,"x":80,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"The Dolefaren, Common Room","descriptions":["The dim interior of the ship is lit by scattered brass lanterns hanging along the walls.  A Merelew woman with green hair and silver scales serves the delicacies of her people to the restaurant's guests at several wood tables."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Dolefaren","inn"]},
  {"id":139,"x":80,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Two Doors Down, Salesroom","descriptions":["Pale cream walls are trimmed with matching painted baseboards and crown molding, giving a subtle warmth to the shop.  That radiance is enhanced by the oil lamps hanging from the ceiling.  The expensive merchandise is displayed on hinged mounts, allowing purchasers to examine each offering on both sides."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go painted hatch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["doors"]},
  {"id":140,"x":120,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Capture the Bag, Shop","descriptions":["Planks of weathered driftwood line the walls although there are a number of gaps between the slabs.  Everything has a ramshackle look except for the merchandise offered on the driftwood displays covering the bare earth floor."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":141,"x":100,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Highway Robbery Redux, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Mannequins dominate the room, frozen in various positions that mimic life.  A gold-covered mannequin stands near one dressed as a town guard while a striped mannequin stands behind them both.  A clerical mitre is atop a bright red mannequin with a short ragged mannequin nearby.  At the back wall lurks a final grey mannequin, half-hidden in the shadows of the tent.  Displays, shelves, and cabinets hold further merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go jacquard flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":142,"x":200,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Hot Tropics, Sunkissed Sands","descriptions":["Golden candlelight flickers over the colorful shells arranged in an intricate swirl across the tall walls.  A tufted rug is stretched over the mottled yellow wooden floorboards.  Colorful sundresses and sarongs hang on metal racks arranged around the room."],"exits":[{"to":143,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":"go avodire-framed door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":143,"x":200,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Hot Tropics, Shifting Seas","descriptions":["White cumulus clouds painted along the top of the bright sky-blue walls shimmer under the warm candlelight like fluffy tufts of cotton caught on an errant sea breeze.  The pale yellow ayabere floors are polished to a high shine to best display the wood's natural mottling.  Various wares are displayed atop a trio of tables in the middle of the room."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":144,"x":220,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"A Shot in the Shark, Salesroom","descriptions":["A solitary lantern gently flickers, casting a dim glow across the compact space under the canvas ceiling.  Against the tent walls, several shelves and tables are subtly lit by the lantern's modest radiance.  The limited illumination grants an enigmatic charm to this diminutive room."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["shot in the shark"]},
  {"id":145,"x":240,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Never Too Late Once More, Quick Gifts","descriptions":["Lit by softly glowing gaezthen globes, polished plaques and framed pictures line the wall near the door.  Two porcelain wedding cakes stand in the center of the room, rising from the dusky velvet carpet to the height of the polished mahogany counter.  Other merchandise is displayed on a variety of shelves and racks."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":146,"x":240,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Never Too Late Once More","descriptions":["A set of tall figures grouped to resemble a wedding party stand beneath a large sign on the far wall, divided from the rest of the room by a heavy velvet rope.  Merchandise is displayed on tables, counters, and shelves.  Several clerks stand nearby, ready to assist the hurried customers."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":147,"x":180,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"A Second Round, Tent","descriptions":["Dingy canvas walls encircle a floor of uneven pine planks.  A few spots of mold or mildew spread across the fabric, adding a note of mustiness to the still air.  A few battered tables hold the merchandise which is heaped up with no sign of organization."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["second round"]},
  {"id":148,"x":200,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Tighten Up!, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Bare whitewashed walls accentuate the wild colors and patterns of the merchandise displayed on shelves and counters.  A few free-standing racks in the center of the room hold more wares for the milling customers to peruse and purchase."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":"go tall door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":149,"x":160,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Amylia's Attic, Accessories","descriptions":["Stacks of crates, barrels, and all kinds of junk fill this shop, making it seem smaller than it is.  Dead stuffed birds hang from the ceiling while dirty, torn parchments litter the floor.  Racks of merchadise mix with the rest of the shop's clutter."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":"go exit door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":150,"x":120,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Clothes By Any Other Flame, Showroom","descriptions":["The canvas walls are painted a brilliant red, similar to the shade of a leaping flame.  The wooden racks and shelves that hold the merchandise are colored in the same hue, while the floor is planks of broad pine.  Helpful salespeople circulate through the crowds, answering questions and making sales."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":151,"x":160,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Trees Four Walls, Showroom","descriptions":["Large mockups of walls hang from the rafters, allowing the patrons to view the various offerings from a variety of distances.  The deep pile carpet on the floor muffles most sounds, helping to foster the mood of quiet contemplation amongst the shoppers.  The saleshelp unobtrusively circulates and are ready to answer questions or place orders."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go tall door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":152,"x":140,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Inkspressions, Written Wonders","descriptions":["Pale green walls stenciled with twining ivy enclose this spacious room, and a deep blue rug covers the majority of its goldenoak floor.  Gaethzen lanterns hang from the ceiling to illuminate the tables and stands displaying wares for sale."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go slender door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":153,"x":80,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Arachnomancy, Advent","descriptions":["Surprisingly roomy, this wagon is the most spacious of the three, providing ample room for dramatic demonstrations.  Spidersilk tapestries drape the wooden walls, concealing the patina of age.  Doorways to the east and west provide access to the adjacent wagons."],"exits":[{"to":154,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":155,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":"go wagon door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":154,"x":100,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Arachnomancy, Incantation","descriptions":["A constellation of tiny gaethzen spiders provides just enough light to see, while heavy spidersilk carpets muffle the footsteps of customers and onlookers."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":155,"x":60,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Arachnomancy, Departure","descriptions":["Gaethzen spiders dangle from the ceiling, perhaps providing a little too much illumination.  The walls are shrouded by thick sheets of spidersilk, each of which is crawling with thousands of tiny spiders."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":156,"x":120,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"To The Hammer Born, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Racks and stands displaying the merchandise are scattered across the plain plank floor.  The hide walls of the tent occasionally move slightly in the breeze, but little else disturbs the customers as they browse the selection of weapons on offer."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["The Hammer Born","Hammer Born"]},
  {"id":157,"x":80,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Adaptive Botany, Showroom","descriptions":["A verdant wonderland of vibrant, lush vela'tohr foliage surrounds you, and the very air thrums with their chatter and excitement.  Aged oak shelving is filled with ceramic pots and planters, each overflowing with tendrils and vines which chaotically intertwine, covering almost every surface in slowly shifting foliage.  Several thick glass windows cover the ceiling, being opened and shut by caretakers to control the room's humidity to best suit the vela'tohr inhabitants.  A team of empath botanists tend to the flora, softly conversing with the plants as they work."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":158,"x":100,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Everlasting Beauty, Foyer","descriptions":["Clean and inviting, this spacious beauty shop reflects a magical merging of nature's beauty and versatility.  Durian wood flooring and smooth peach walls encompass the vast room.  The large mirror affixed to the wall allows the shoppers a place to admire their beauty.  A sizeable handmade tapestry on one wall depicts a colorful forest.  Goldwood furniture pieces fill the room displaying a wide variety of cosmetics and supplies.  An intricately carved door leads outside while a small arch leads to another room."],"exits":[{"to":159,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go apricot door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":159,"x":100,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Everlasting Beauty, Parlor","descriptions":["Clean and inviting, this spacious beauty shop reflects a magical merging of nature's beauty and versatility.  Durian wood flooring and amber walls encompass the vast room.  The large mirror affixed to the wall allows the shoppers a place to admire their beauty.  Goldwood furniture pieces fill the room displaying a wide variety of hair and beauty supplies.  A small arch leads back to the main room."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":160,"x":80,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Affair of the Art, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Except for the colors provided by the merchandise, the room is an unrelieved white - white walls, white floors, white ceilings, and white counter.  Large empty spaces between the artworks allow for each piece to be properly appreciated without distractions from other works.  Gaethzen globes provide a steady and safe lighting for all the wares."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":161,"x":60,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Affair of the Art, Back Room","descriptions":["White walls, white floors, white ceilings, and a white counter provide a non-distracting backdrop for the colorful artwork on display.  Gaethzen globes hang from the ceiling and provide illumination.  Silent sales staff move about, ready to answer any questions."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":162,"x":120,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Fit to be Tied, Shop","descriptions":["Except for the canvas walls and the wooden racks, this narrow space is lacking in decoration.  The only color comes from the brilliant shades of the merchandise on the racks scattered about."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":163,"x":160,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Tower of Terror, Shop","descriptions":["Sturdy racks and stands holding the merchandise are scattered around the shopfloor.  Careful lighting throws spotlights on the various items and draws attention to the exquisite craftsmanship on display."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":164,"x":140,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"A Knight in Shining Scholar, Salesroom","descriptions":["The room exudes an air of tranquility, adorned with towering shelves brimming with an impressive collection of books.  Soft indirect lighting enhances the wood-paneled ambiance.  Racks and counters display the scholar-themed merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":"go wide door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["knight in shining scholar"]},
  {"id":165,"x":120,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Wheel or no Wheel, Main Room","descriptions":["Colorful cages with intricate tunnels and wheels line the shelves on the walls, showcasing the adorable pets within.  The sound of gentle squeaks and rustling bedding fills the air as customers debate which animals to purchase.  The knowledgeable staff offers insights and advice to the potential pet owners."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":"go circular door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":166,"x":160,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Garden of Plenty, Workroom","descriptions":["Vivid murals of bamboo benches overlooking glistening waterfalls, butterflies fluttering around neatly trimmed hedges, climbing plants, and colorful flowers surrounding the lush grass field cover the walls of this small shed.  Bamboo furniture showcasing a variety of wares stands out against the deep green floor.  An elegantly carved bamboo door with a painted design leads back outside, while a small vine-covered arch in the back leads to another room."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":"go bamboo door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":167,"x":160,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Garden of Plenty, Boutique","descriptions":["Vivid murals of glistening waterfalls, butterflies fluttering around neatly trimmed hedges, climbing plants, and colorful flowers surrounding the lush grass field cover the walls of this small room.  Bamboo furniture showcasing a variety of wares stand out against the deep green floor.  A small vine-covered arch in the back leads to another room."],"exits":[{"to":166,"exit":"go","move":"go small arch"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":168,"x":180,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Familiar Treats, Inside","descriptions":["Blocks of glittering sand create a boxy room with an inviting, open space.  Starglass sconces have been strategically positioned to highlight sales displays spaced around the room."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":"go open doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":169,"x":200,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"In The Snow, Outerwear","descriptions":["Plain white wainscotting runs along the walls, dividing the white plastered top from the blue painted bottom.  Oak planks provide the floor which has a number of racks painted in various shades of blue scattered across it.  Iron sconces hold gaethzen spheres which illuminate the room and the merchandise displayed on the racks."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":170,"x":200,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Gift Me Up, Shop","descriptions":["A multitude of shelves and racks hold a variety of merchandise and goods for sale.  The whole shop is stuffed with items and the floor is piled with baskets and bins of overflow items."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":"go wagon door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":171,"x":280,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Granny's Knot Spot, Cozy Shop","descriptions":["A rocking chair sits next to the fireplace, a basket of knitting beside it on the floor.  The whitewashed stone walls hold wooden shelves while some wooden racks and stands are scattered about the floor."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":172,"x":300,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Unique-corn, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Oak shelving lines the walls, displaying the varied wares of the shop.  Globes filled with gaethzen dangle from the ceiling, providing illumination for the customers.  Clerks bustle about refreshing the merchandise supply and answering shoppers' questions."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":173,"x":200,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"A Quick Bite, Salesroom","descriptions":["Something keeps this room perpetually chilly, almost the temperature of an icehouse on a summer day.  Gleaming metal walls contrast with the warmth of the hand-polished wooden racks displaying the shop's wares.  A butcher block counter stands in one corner."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Quick Bite"]},
  {"id":174,"x":180,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Pi'rasha's Pins","descriptions":["Large brass stand lamps burn brightly along each tapestry-hung wall, their shining reflectors wrought into the shapes of stylized rising suns.  A carved sandalwood table bears some trays, with sturdy racks and mannequins holding cloaks standing nearby.  Exuberantly colored carpets in rich reds and golds muffle the footfalls of those who visit here."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go tapestry flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Pins"]},
  {"id":175,"x":160,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"See the Light, Kermorian Divinity","descriptions":["Aurulent curtains are draped along the walls of lifesculpted coral, lending a majestic air to the space, while luxurious rugs muffle the sounds of footsteps and of conversations.  Thirteen gilded lanterns provide ample illumination."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":176,"x":140,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"See the Light, Foreign Powers","descriptions":["Sanguine swathes accentuate the walls of lifesculpted coral, lending bursts of color to the space, while exotic rugs muffle the sounds of footsteps and of conversations.  Several flickering torches illuminate the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":177,"x":280,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Glam and Gritty, Anteroom","descriptions":["Elegant ebony cabinets display wares behind slightly grimy glass doors.  The polished wood of the floors shines through the occasional patch of scuffing that really could use some cleaning.  A brass and glass chandelier hangs from the ceiling, its perfection only slightly marred by a small spiderweb run between two of the candleholders."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":178,"x":280,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Glam and Gritty, Main Floor","descriptions":["The dark ebony floors contrast with the pale, almost white, wood of the birch paneling on the walls.  Matching ebony shelves are set slightly askew on the walls, almost as if the builders were in too much of a hurry to actually make sure they were level.  A few dust bunnies lurk in the corners, having escaped the lackluster cleaning of the salesforce."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":177,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":179,"x":280,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Glam and Gritty, Alcove","descriptions":["Tucked into a corner are a couple of brooms, the dust and cobwebs covering them a mute testimony to how little use they see.  A few scuffed storage boxes litter the floor, the lids leaning against them while they spill packing straw around the floor."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":180,"x":300,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Wally's World of Walls, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Plain pine planks form the interior walls of this minimalist showroom.  The deliberate lack of decoration throughout the room is designed to emphasize the exotic woods and flamboyant patterns of the merchandise samples displayed throught the store."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":181,"x":280,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Sleepwalkers, Salesroom","descriptions":["Soft flannel drapes and plush cushions surround the area, inviting patrons to curl up for a nap after putting on their new purchases.  Piles of folded pajamas in assorted patterns and colors mound over a large, padded table, while two baskets nearby are full of fluffy foot coverings.  A padded shelf hangs on the wall, opposite the curtain."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":"go flannel curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":182,"x":340,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Hero To Go, Supplies","descriptions":["Maps, sketches and paintings from all over Elanthia cover the plastered walls.  One wall is entirely taken up by a mural of an erupting volcano while a large model of a mechanical dragon hangs from the ceiling.  Opposite the mural, a gilded frame displays pressed phofe flower specimens next to a very large sign."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go exit door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":183,"x":360,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Hero To Go, Clothing","descriptions":["Unlike the first room of the shop, this one is bare of anything but merchandise and the displays for the merchandise.  Plastered walls hold some shelves and hooks, while the floor is crowded with racks and stands for wares."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":182,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":184,"x":380,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Hero To Go, Back Room","descriptions":["The room is devoid of anything except for merchandise and the corresponding displays. The walls are covered with shelves and hooks, while the floor is filled with racks and stands showcasing various wares."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":185,"x":300,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Natural Beauty, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Thick tapestries depicting a dense, wild forest surrounding a picturesque glade cover the walls, each blending seamlessly into the next.  The tall ceiling painted to resemble a cloudless summer sky features a gaethzen sun positioned directly in the center.  Polished driftwood furniture set up around the room displays a wide variety of garments available for sale."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood arch"},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go ayabere door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":186,"x":300,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Natural Beauty, Special Occasions","descriptions":["Smooth metal walls painted to resemble a nighttime garden seem to almost disappear beneath the layered colors.  Swirled blues and purples adorn the blackened ceiling, fading down to brush the tops of the foliage with their velvety embrace.  Tiny, glowing pieces of gaethzen dot the mural, from fireflies amongst the flowers to stars laboriously placed to recreate constellations, providing a diffuse but adequate source of light by which to examine the shop's surfaces.  A stylish aybere jewelry case and polished driftwood counter display a wide range of goods for sale."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood arch"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":187,"x":300,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Grave New World, Main Room","descriptions":["Moss clings to the dark grey stone walls which meet overhead in an arched ceiling.  A few scattered lamps try to dispel the gloom but mostly fail.  Spiderwebs cover the corners, their sticky strands spanning the distance and holding small web-wrapped bundles of caught insects."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go crypt door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":188,"x":440,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Craftsmen's Academy","descriptions":["Six stone columns are placed equidistant from one another around the chamber's perimeter and hold the dome overhead aloft.  Merelew smiths, tinkers, tailors and other craftsmen huddle about their landwalker counterparts and engage in spirited discussions about their particular trades.  From time to time, such a group will make their way towards nearby crafting stations so one craftsman or another can demonstrate a particular technique."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":192,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":193,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":194,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":190,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":33,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["crafting"]},
  {"id":189,"x":460,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, Engineers' Enclave","descriptions":["Materials, gadgets, weapons, and so many other contraptions are scattered about haphazardly without any recognizable sense of organization.  In one area is a collection of dozens of bones ranging in size from small, rat-like creatures all the way up to ones that surely belonged to a leviathan.  Some are bleached, others are scrimshawed, and still others glow with illusory sigils hovering about them.  A group of Merelew hunters are gathered around a table showing off various crossbow designs and are engaged in a seemingly never-ending debate about how or if such devices could be used practically beneath the waves.  From time to time, as one moves away, another approaches and begins the debate anew."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":191,"exit":"go","move":"go doorways"}],"aliases":["tinkering","engineering","shaping"]},
  {"id":190,"x":420,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, Hall of Forges","descriptions":["A row of forges stands opposite a matching row of anvils, and curtains of thick hides are suspended from the ceiling to help contain and redirect the smoky air and heat towards windows and vents higher up.  They also serve to soften the constant clanging of metal striking metal as craftsmen show off specialized techniques to accomplish their creative designs.  Private forges lie beyond guarded doorways nearby for those unwilling to disclose their secrets in the more public spaces here."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":316,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"aliases":["forging","blacksmithing","armorsmithing"]},
  {"id":191,"x":460,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, A Private Engineering Room","descriptions":["A fine layer of wood and stone shavings covers most of the well-worn granite floor.  The white walls have seen better days, and black and grey scuff marks adorn much of the open space.  A large workstation along one wall is unnaturally free of clutter and holds several organized tools and implements.  Grunts, curses, and labored breathing from other patrons echo throughout the large workroom."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"go","move":"go doorways"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":192,"x":460,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, Tailors' Stich 'n Snitch","descriptions":["A trio of spinning wheels sit between a handful of looms, and all are arranged in a horseshoe shape around a platform that showcases various Merelew fashions intermixed with vibrant fabrics, thick furs and other textiles from the mainlands.  Several elderly ladies walk the circuit, taking turns sharing stories and showing off knitting techniques as they furiously work their needles with yarn carefully feeding out of satchels slung over their shoulders.  Some guarded doorways are tucked away along a back wall."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":325,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"aliases":["outfitting","tailoring"]},
  {"id":193,"x":440,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, Applied Artificing","descriptions":["A series of guarded doorways line a segment of the wall here.  Scattered between them are tables with differently styled magical founts, beads and wands of different metals, woods and stones, and other tools commonly used by artificers.  Several strange contraptions also serve as a gathering point where a Merelew Enchantress tries to explain their purpose, but the perplexed expressions of those gathered about her don't seem promising."],"exits":[{"to":326,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"},{"to":188,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["enchanting","artificing"]},
  {"id":194,"x":420,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, Association of Alchemists","descriptions":["Shelves are lined with jars of pastes, unguents, potions and other finished remedies.  Tables set along a windowed wall display several variations of the Wayerd pyramid, some with cambrinth and others without.  Overhead, numerous clumps of colorful dried and drying herbs are bundled with lengths of seaweed that dangle from a large fishing net -- all of which provide a heady, medicinal aroma.  Additional stations lie beyond guarded doorways."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":319,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"aliases":["alchemy"]},
  {"id":195,"x":360,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Killer Pinks, Fatally Aggressive","descriptions":["Coralite lanterns dangle freely from petalette cords strung across the high ceiling and cast a pinkish-gold light across the glossy black floor.  The ricepaper walls are vertically striped in shades of mauve and cream, each lined with coralite hooks bearing various bows and crossbows.  Narrow tables shoved into the corners display additional weapons available for purchase."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"go elegant archway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":196,"x":380,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Killer Pinks, Define Outcomes","descriptions":["Lengths of peachy-pink spun glitter cover the room's walls, their metallic threads shimmering beautifully beneath the soft light cast by an ornate coralite chandelier hanging from the center of the room.  Freestanding mannequins are artfully arranged across the bright pink floor to highlight their wares."],"exits":[{"to":195,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":197,"x":320,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Shimmers of Silver","descriptions":["Despite the rather small confines of this long, narrow hall, careful attention has been given to the expensive-looking decorations.  The white walls prominently showcase several small glass windows that look into elegant sculptures of colored glass, and bright lighting in the ceiling of their small cabinets shines onto the the works of art."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":198,"x":320,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Entry","descriptions":["A few benches along the walls provide seating for those who need a break from shopping.  Warm light from the hanging brass chandelier spreads throughout the entry, making the polished oak floors gleam."],"exits":[{"to":199,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Knight at the Club"]},
  {"id":199,"x":320,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Outerwear","descriptions":["Spread out around the room are wooden racks and stands displaying a wide variety of outerwear.  Rushing salesclerks move about, answering questions and restocking clothing."],"exits":[{"to":198,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":204,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":200,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":200,"x":300,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Gowns and Robes","descriptions":["Long racks of robes and gowns line the walls, their wooden poles almost groaning under the weight of the merchandise.  The quiet murmur of voices fills the air as customers debate their purchases."],"exits":[{"to":199,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":201,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":201,"x":300,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Accessories","descriptions":["A long walnut counter displays accessories and other extras for purchase.  A few bins and baskets on the floor provide extra display space for further items."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":202,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":202,"x":320,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Jewelry","descriptions":["Glass cases and cabinets along the walls offer up jewelry and other adornments for perusal and purchase.  Several armed guards stand in the corners, their gimlet eyes keeping the customers under watch to prevent theft."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":201,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":203,"x":340,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Doublets and Shirts","descriptions":["Garments hang from the racks and stands around the room, their colorful fabrics and trims dazzling to the eye.  Cheerful salespeople roam about, ready to answer questions or get a different item from the stockroom."],"exits":[{"to":204,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":202,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":204,"x":340,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"A Knight at the Club, Legwear","descriptions":["Piles of clothing are stacked up on shelves and counters, ready for purchase by customers.  Smiling clerks answer questions and help the buyers with their other requirements."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":199,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":205,"x":400,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Future is Now, Armillary Sphere","descriptions":["Contained within the gargantuan iron sphere that forms this chamber are dozens of massive brass rings connected to a globe via a thick central axis.  Ceaselessly, the rings twirl and spin about in silent harmony, no two plotting the same course.  Prominently featured upon each is a limelight which collectively casts a multihued kaleidoscope of illumination about the room.  A particularly wide ring slowly plots a course that offers customers a relatively safe path between the entrance and exit of the shop proper."],"exits":[{"to":206,"exit":"go","move":"go entrance"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go exit"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":206,"x":400,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"The Future is Now, Workshop","descriptions":["The once spacious workshop is cramped by mechanical flights of fantasy.  Many are little more than carefully annotated blueprints, scattered springs and stray gears, while others proudly proclaim their completion with scribbled price tags.  Some merchandise lies in tangles and piles of clutter, while others sprawl across the workbench, a side table, the assorted shelving and even the walls."],"exits":[{"to":205,"exit":"go","move":"go egress"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Future is Now"]},
  {"id":207,"x":420,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Tick Tock, Sales Floor","descriptions":["From behind a counter, a clerk carefully cleans fingerprints and other smudges from the wares proudly displayed throughout the small room.  A shadesatin-lined tray of fancy clockwork devices is set on a counter between a black bust and some alerce pegs showcasing similar mechanical creations.  Metal keys matching the various gadgets hang from some aldamdin hooks."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":208,"x":420,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Whimsies","descriptions":["As customers enter this brightly lit shop, ribbons and bells sway, and jingle as the door opens and closes.   Along its fine oak walls is fanciful coralite furniture piled with goods for sale."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go plank door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":209,"x":380,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Eluned's Dreams in Flesh","descriptions":["The mother-of-pearl walls are a pristine white, reflecting light in iridescent swirls.  Cabinets are stocked with dyes of every imaginable color and shade.  Comfortable looking benches and stools are spaced about the room.  Small tables are setup in the corners of the shop."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go round doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":210,"x":420,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Swish Slash and Stab, Salesroom","descriptions":["Sleek racks and neatly organized shelves showcase an array of stylish garments.  Bright lighting accentuates the vibrant colors and intricate designs, allowing each piece to shine in its own right.  Mirrors strategically placed around the space invite shoppers to envision themselves in the latest fashions."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go tall door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":211,"x":340,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Floors for Thought, Main Salesfloor","descriptions":["Metal racks with rollout shelves line the walls, each shelf displaying a different sample of floor covering for perusal.  Windows high in the walls provide lighting during daylight hours, with hanging gaethzen globes available during evening hours."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":212,"x":360,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Floors for Thought, Refined Tastes","descriptions":["In contrast to the main salesfloor, the racks in this room are crafted from the finest tropical hardwoods.  The flooring in the room is plain ash planking, but of such a fine finish that it is like walking on satin.  Leaded glass clerestory windows allow in clear sunlight to aid the patrons in their selections."],"exits":[{"to":211,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":213,"x":320,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Haunted House, Front Hall","descriptions":["Dark red candles burn in small braziers on either side of the arched doorway, the myriad of rugs spread across the floor awash with the eerie light.  Several chests line the sides of the small room, watchful eyes painted above them on the completely black walls.  Shadows run deep in every corner, relentlessly assaulting the imagination with images of childhood monsters."],"exits":[{"to":214,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":215,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Haunted House"]},
  {"id":214,"x":340,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Haunted House, Study","descriptions":["Standing in a battle-ready position with both hands gripped on their swords, a row of empty plate armor lines the northern wall, which is hung with moth-eaten purple drapes.  On the southern side of the room, a skeletal horse with a fleshless knight mounted on its back is poised toward the armor, making the only path to the wares pass directly in the line of fire of both sides.  Thin floorboards have been painted a dull grey, doing little to hide the extensive wear and tear."],"exits":[{"to":213,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":215,"x":300,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Haunted House, Bedroom","descriptions":["Rather well lit with a single bright candle set in a grubby lantern, the room is laid out with several pieces of furniture, which are arranged neatly.  Though antique at best, the pieces lining the room are masterfully carved.  Each has a somewhat sinister air about it, the arrangement of chairs and headboards throwing sharp shadows on the walls in macabre patterns.  Treacherous holes in the floor are precariously patched over with thin boards, offering little safety."],"exits":[{"to":213,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":216,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":217,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":216,"x":280,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Haunted House, Kennel","descriptions":["Several cages are dimly visible in the poorly lit room, their doors tightly bolted.  Shining eyes blink out from the darkness, some natural and some seeming otherworldly, glowing red and standing out in the darkness.  A low brazier burns in the corner of the room, doing little to chase away the oppressive shadows."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":217,"x":300,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Haunted House, Attic","descriptions":["The cramped room resembles a large crawlspace underneath a peaked roof, with the sharply slanted ceiling intersecting the floor on the eastern side.  A single candle is set on the sill of a frosted window, throwing the room into a myriad of light and shadow.  Cobwebs clutter every corner of the small room and drape over dreary pieces of furniture."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":218,"x":300,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Urbane Outfitters, Sales","descriptions":["Intricately patterned wallpaper in muted hues complements rich, dark wooden furniture adorned with luxurious upholstery.  Ornate chandeliers and sconces cast a warm glow over the space, highlighting the refined details and plush fabrics.  A few shelves and racks display the merchandise on offer."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":219,"x":360,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Field Fashion, Not-Really-Skirts","descriptions":["Palm fronds cover the walls, providing partial cover from the elements.  The raised floor is sanded teak planks which support a variety of racks and stands for the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":220,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":221,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go screened door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":220,"x":380,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Field Fashion, Things That Are Still Not Skirts","descriptions":["Tucked into the back of the cabana is this airy room with large open screened windows.  A few shelves and racks showcase the items for sale."],"exits":[{"to":219,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":221,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":221,"x":340,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Field Fashion, Long Things That Might Trip You","descriptions":["Instead of palm frond walls, the room is enclosed with louvered panels that help to keep the elements out without impeding air flow.  The merchandise is displayed on counters and tables."],"exits":[{"to":220,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":219,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":222,"x":380,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Urn Back Time, Front Room","descriptions":["A framework of oak poles holds up the canvas sides, which are decorated with painted designs in red and black depicting people in flowing clothes marching in procession.  A few lanterns hanging from the roofpoles provide lighting for the shop's wares displayed on the wooden shelves and racks about the area."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":223,"x":380,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Urn Back Time, Back Room","descriptions":["A framework of oak poles holds up the canvas sides, which are decorated with painted designs in red and black depicting people in long robes parading through a city street.  A few lanterns hanging from the roofpoles provide lighting for the shop's wares displayed on the wooden shelves and racks about the area."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":224,"x":360,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"The Eyes Have It, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Stepping into the shop, there is an inviting ambiance with soft, pastel hues adorning the walls and plush, cream-colored carpet underfoot.   Oil lanterns overhead create a warm and comforting glow, illuminating the tastefully arranged shelves and racks.  A few sales clerks mingle with the shoppers, answering questions and straightening merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go solid door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Eyes Have It"]},
  {"id":225,"x":480,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Only The Holy, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Frescos depicting the Immortals cover the wall, each depicted with their symbols and animals.  The exposed roof beams have been carved into a running frieze of holy symbols, leaving no surface undecorated.  In contrast to the roof beams, the racks and shelves displaying the merchandise are of plain wood."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":226,"x":440,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Jynli's Cattery HE Wing, Main Room","descriptions":["Large spacious cages line the walls, each outfitted with a comfortable bed and a scratching post as well as full water and food bowls.  Behind the mesh, each cage displays one of the exotic cats that Jynli is known for.  The pets are mostly sleeping, but a few stare boldly out at the customers wandering around."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go cat-shaped door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cattery"]},
  {"id":227,"x":480,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Pita Pan, Mainroom","descriptions":["Plain walls enclose a mostly bare room with just a counter for the salesclerks and a large table displaying the wares.  A few lamps provide subdued lighting in line with the minimalist feel of the shop's fixtures."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":228,"x":460,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Entrance","descriptions":["Opulent tapestries ring the walls of the spacious vestibule, while thick plush rugs blanket the gleaming wooden floors.  Low benches of polished deobar wood flank the entry flap.  One lone table stands in the middle of the carpeted floor, a branching candelabra positioned carefully on a pristine white tablecloth."],"exits":[{"to":236,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":235,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":230,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":229,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":229,"x":440,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Hats","descriptions":["Plush pile carpets dyed in swirls of white and light purple cover the floor, hiding the waxed wood from view.  Thin amethyst-colored silken curtains isolate the space from the remainder of the tent.  Hats are piled in profusion on polished rowan wood tables and stands."],"exits":[{"to":228,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":235,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":230,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":230,"x":440,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Kilts","descriptions":["Aspen flooring, nearly hidden beneath the sumptuous pink plush carpets, covers the ground. The opulent merchandise available for purchase is showcased on aspen tables and racks. Delicate, airy fabric in shades of pink elegantly partitions this space from the expansive tent's surroundings."],"exits":[{"to":229,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":228,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":235,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":231,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":231,"x":460,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Pants","descriptions":["Opulent rugs of thick wool completely cover the ground, allowing patrons to browse in comfort.  Folded pants are stacked on the aromatic cedarwood tables and counters.  Wispy curtains of translucent emerald-green silk screen the area from the rest of the tent."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":234,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":233,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":232,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":230,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":232,"x":440,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Doublets","descriptions":["Fine-grained teak shelves and stands set out the luxurious offerings on sale.  Wispy fabric drapes the shade of watermelon tourmaline help to section off this area from the rest of the commodious tent.  Flooring of dark teak covers the floor, its surface almost totally concealed beneath the fuchsia-colored plush carpets."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":233,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":233,"x":460,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Cloaks","descriptions":["Intricately figured cocobolo wood racks and wardrobes display a profusion of brilliantly colored wares.  Amber-colored sheer silken drapes delineate the section of the tent devoted to cloaks and other outerwear.  Deep yellow wool pile carpets muffle all sounds of movement."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":234,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":232,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":234,"x":480,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Shoes","descriptions":["Burnished lunat wood stands and racks stand in the center of a midnight blue wool rug covering the matching plank floor.  Shoes and boots in a myriad of styles grace the polished surfaces.  Wispy draperies dyed a deep sapphire blue section the area off from the rest of the tent."],"exits":[{"to":233,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":231,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":235,"x":460,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Shirts","descriptions":["Silken gauze curtains dyed in jewel-tones partition the interior of the tent into smaller sections.  Surrounding this section are delicate drapes in pale blue-greens the color of aquamarines.  Gleaming white ash racks and tables hold brilliantly colored wares."],"exits":[{"to":228,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":236,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":231,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":230,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":229,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":236,"x":480,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"All The King's Men, Gloves","descriptions":["Pearlescent ivory-hued panels crafted from diaphanous silk hang from tent poles inlaid with narrow bands of mother-of-pearl.  Woven wool rugs dyed a pale grey that is almost white cover the ground, providing a space for the icethorn shelves and tables displaying merchandise.  Discreet salesclerks circulate among the customers to answer questions."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":228,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":237,"x":300,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Emperor's New Robes, Outlet","descriptions":["Lofty tentpoles hold up the striped roof which soars overhead.  Multi-hued bands of silk run vertically along the walls, making the interior a riot of color even without the kaleidoscopic hues of the merchandise.  Racks and stands display the wares on offer while salesclerks bustle about."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":"go pavilion flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Emperor's New Robes"]},
  {"id":238,"x":320,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Pack to Basics, Salesroom","descriptions":["The shed is a haven for adventure seekers and avid travelers, adorned with an array of rugged, versatile, and stylish containers.  Friendly and knowledgeable staff stand ready to assist, helping customers find the perfect container to accompany them on their journeys."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":239,"x":260,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Animal Market, Main Room","descriptions":["Wooden walls, painted with realistic murals of mountains and forests, surround a planked floor decorated with a design of grass and pebbles.  Recessed lighting in the sky-blue ceiling allows for lighting to be focused on the surfaces displaying the shop's merchandise.  Salesclerks bustle about, answering questions and restocking the wares."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":240,"x":280,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Cause for Locket, Salesroom","descriptions":["Displays and showcases fill this emporium, each one offering an array of merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":241,"x":260,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Fall's Harvest","descriptions":["An oilcloth tarp covers this small area, the long oak poles holding it up bearing hooks of apple-themed merchandise.  Brightly painted apples in shades of red, green and gold hang from the sides of the cloth overhead."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go cloth curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":242,"x":300,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Hunka's Seaside Delights, Front Room","descriptions":["Enclosed within smooth driftwood walls, the shop is dominated by a wraparound seaglass counter that is flanked by a large cookware display and some salvaged rope netting.  Colorful paper lanterns in the shape of various fish are suspended from the ceiling in playful clusters."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":243,"x":260,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Focus on the Past, Relic Room","descriptions":["Several soil-stained packing crates stacked along the back encroach towards the interior at random intervals, detracting from the otherwise orderly desk where recent finds are cataloged.  Various shelves and bookcases occupy much of the remaining space, holding artifacts marked and tagged from previous expeditions.  A slight mustiness lingers in the air, infusing the room with the dampness imagined held within the tomb or temple where these artifacts originated."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go rustic doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":244,"x":260,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"The Other Siegery Shop","descriptions":["Elaborate tapestries hang from the four walls in colorful banners.  Each is decorated with an army marching over fields and meadows, ready to clash with an opposing army on the opposite banner.  Incandescent lights hang from the ceiling, illuminating numerous tables filled with miniature figures and a lone shelf with sets for sale."],"exits":[{"to":245,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Other Siegery Shop"]},
  {"id":245,"x":260,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Other Siegery Shop, Team Gear","descriptions":["Elaborate tapestries hang from the four walls in colorful banners.  Each is decorated with an army marching over fields and meadows, ready to clash with an opposing army on the opposite banner.  Incandescent lights hang from the ceiling, illuminating the various sales surfaces."],"exits":[{"to":244,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":246,"x":300,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Stick and Stable, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Khaki-colored canvas walls are covered with painted murals of stylized animals running and jumping.  Set out on the straw-covered floor are simple wooden racks that showcase the wares on offer.  Throughout the space, a faint scent of freshly sawn wood mixes with the dried grass smell from stalks strewn on the floor."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":247,"x":320,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"The Musiceum, Orchestral Manoeuvres","descriptions":["Dark sable velvet drapery has been hung from ceiling to wall, swathing the room in near blackness.  The darkness is staved off completely by several gaethzen globes hung by near invisible wire that have been carefully positioned over the display cases to allow the wares for sale to be seen clearly.  Nestled between the swathes of cloth, cases and instrument tools have been hung on pegboards to show them off to their best advantage."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Musiceum"]},
  {"id":248,"x":340,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"The Musiceum, Amber Room","descriptions":["Set up in an octagonal shape, this room has been fitted with amber panels throughout.  Behind each panel, light has been set up to allow the amber to glow like a warm fire as well as highlighting the tiny bubbles and animals trapped within.  Ornate gold hardware secures each panel to the next, blending almost seamlessly with the tawny-hue of the paneling.  Three gaethzen globes suspend above the empty room, while a large hanging sign has been strung up to rest immediately below the middle globe."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Kouzan"]},
  {"id":249,"x":300,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Creature's Pet, Main Tent","descriptions":["Oiled canvas walls encompass the interior, providing protection from the elements for both the customers and the living merchandise.  Sturdy cages are scattered throughout the area, each one displaying one of the pets on offer.  Shoppers inspect the various animals, while the animals growl, hiss, or screech back as the mood takes them."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":250,"x":300,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"What A Steel!, Shop","descriptions":["Sturdy displays showcase an array of weapons, from swords to pikes.  The space is organized and well-lit, allowing customers to carefully examine each item while knowledgeable staff provide information on functionality and proper usage."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":251,"x":180,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Looty Booty, Entrance","descriptions":["Plain birch walls circumscribe the room, lacking any embellishment or adornment.  A square doorway leads further into the shop, while a simple chain dangling from the ceiling holds a gaethzen sphere that illuminates the sparse alcove."],"exits":[{"to":252,"exit":"go","move":"go square doorway"},{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":"go birch door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":252,"x":160,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Looty Booty, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Glass-fronted wooden cabinets line the walls, their black velvet-covered shelves displaying the exquisite wares to a well-heeled clientele.  The pale woods of the paneling and floor provide a sharp contrast to the plush ebony-hued shelving.  Genteel salespeople unobtrusively wait to help the patrons with their selections."],"exits":[{"to":251,"exit":"go","move":"go square doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":253,"x":180,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Things That Go Bump in the Fight, Control Room","descriptions":["Set up in the middle of the floor are a number of utilitarian shelves and racks made of wood.  A few small cubicles are set up along the canvas tent walls so that patrons can try on the merchandise.  The scent of oiled canvas and freshly cut wood still drifts on the air in the confined space."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":254,"x":80,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Entry","descriptions":["Decoration is sparse in the entryway.  A cramped passage leads northward between stacks of empty crates, whose contents are presumably on display elsewhere."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":53,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":255,"x":80,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Nexus","descriptions":["This chamber is the most spacious in the wagon, providing ample room for a crowd to attend a sermon.  A high white marble altar rises majestically in the middle of the room, flanked by tall silver candlesticks which cast a nimbus of warm light across its pale surface.  Shallow alcoves surround the chamber, branching off in all directions."],"exits":[{"to":257,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":258,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":254,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":259,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":256,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":260,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oaken ladder"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":256,"x":60,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Small Alcove","descriptions":["This small alcove has been draped in pearlescent white silken tapestries.  Several large candles held in delicate white-gold floor sconces bathe the area in a gentle glow, causing the tapestries to shimmer beneath the soft caress of the flickering candlelight."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":257,"x":100,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Small Alcove","descriptions":["Soft black velvet tapestries drape the walls of this alcove, bathed in the light of a single candle held from an ornate platinum floor sconce."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":258,"x":100,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Small Alcove","descriptions":["A bizarre mix of gaudiness and subtlety, festive banners adorn one side of this small alcove while plain white cotton tapestries mask the other wall.  A simple iron lantern sways from the ceiling, bathing the area in its glow."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":259,"x":60,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Small Alcove","descriptions":["Deep blue watersilk tapestries cascade down the walls, shimmering in the light of an ornate silver lantern suspended from the ceiling.  The play of color and light against the fabric gives the cramped alcove a spurious illusion of spaciousness."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":260,"x":80,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Sputkin's Splendors, Cramped Loft","descriptions":["Not a single cobweb mars this small loft, allowing a feeling of comfort to permeate throughout.  A single candle rises from a golden floor sconce, casting playfully dancing shadows on the walls."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["scrolls"]},
  {"id":261,"x":60,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Farhana's Island Exquisites, Sales Room","descriptions":["Arched walls are hung with ivory gauze layered over pale rose silk, softening the light of the room and rippling with every breeze.  Tall seagrass baskets filled with honeysuckle blossoms and curls of sandalwood and cinnamon bark are tucked in the corners, lending a light and spicy fragrance to the air.  Big cushions covered with raw silk and edged with tiny golden bells are scattered near the merchandise racks, inviting shoppers to linger and choose."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":262,"x":80,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Kilt From Scratch, Shop","descriptions":["Although the mortar between the bricks is a bit crumbly, the walls are stout and solid.  Counters and shelves display the products for sale, while the busy salespeople bustle about helping customers and replenishing merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["kilts"]},
  {"id":263,"x":60,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Jousting Grounds, Lances and Roses Souvenir Shop","descriptions":["Dolls, ribands and other souvenirs are laid out in neat groups atop the display tables in the shop.  Sales clerks work quickly to maintain the order as items are snatched up by prize-hungry spectators attending the competitions."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":264,"x":40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Eylhaar's Rest, Dive Bar","descriptions":["The air in this dingy bar is thick with the acrid scent of spilled ale and the smoky residue of countless pipes.  Framed by rows of bottles with unrecognizable labels, a massive, weathered painting of a snarling jackal hangs on the wall behind the bar.  Dim lanterns flicker, casting elongated shadows that dance across the uneven stone floor.  Seashells and fishing nets haphazardly decorate the walls."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["bar"]},
  {"id":265,"x":20,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Goblin Treats, Sales Booth","descriptions":["Twisted nails barely hold together the charred woodwork of this crudely-built dilapidated stall.  Molten-red banners drape from the wooden overhang, surrounded by portraits of the face of a goblin warlord, each signed in an illegible script.  A single goblin, very clearly out of his element, staffs the booth.  Large braziers stand out front, roiling with a flame that smokes and hisses, fueled by a reservoir of naphtha."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"go","move":"go open doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":266,"x":40,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Enflamed Effigy, Sales Booth","descriptions":["The interior of this wooden stall carries the musty scent of straw.  Inside the small space, a large display holds rows of straw-stuffed dolls on shelves, their stitched faces bearing painted eyes.  Sunlight filters through the gaps in the cedar planks that form the walls, casting a warm, golden glow over the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"go","move":"go open doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enflamed Effigy"]},
  {"id":267,"x":220,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Artistry of Flesh","descriptions":["The room is low and cell-like, an excess of gaethzen orbs hanging from the ceiling filling the small space with a harsh, sterile light.  The only piece of furniture is a large reclining chair bearing a range of gadgets both mundane and alien.  Samples of flash cover the far wall, the only break from the dull grey wood.  A thin young Kaldaran man, presumably the artist, stands rigidly out of the way with a flat expression."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":"go darkened door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":268,"x":240,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Artistry of Flesh, Side Room","descriptions":["Gaethzen orbs hang from the ceiling and fill this small room with harsh white light, illuminating the sterile space and its lack of decorations.  A small table pushed up against the back wall is covered in a mound of crumpled papers and mangled trinkets, remnants from an unknown project.  Nestled amongst unwanted items is a small catalog."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":269,"x":220,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Dying to Shop, Front of Tent","descriptions":["Black canvas walls have a few openings that allow air and light to come into this large tent.  Fresh grass mats cover the ground while various displays hold the merchandise for sale.  A large white banner hangs between the tentpoles."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":270,"x":220,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Dying to Shop, Back of Tent","descriptions":["Black canvas walls have a few openings that allow air and light to come into this large tent.  Fresh grass mats cover the ground while various displays hold the merchandise for sale.  A large white banner hangs overhead."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":271,"x":180,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Knotty Pirate, Entry","descriptions":["Plain oak paneling covers the walls with rich, yellow-brown wood while the floors are narrower planks of the same wood.  Occupying the central space of the entry is a tall mannequin, dressed in a flamboyant outfit."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":272,"x":180,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Dark Dalliance, Chamber","descriptions":["A hint of perfume upon the air greets all who enter this merchant.  The area is mostly dark, with just a hint of candlelight dancing against the stark obsidian walls.  Merchandise rests upon dark furniture lining each side while a massive throne offers seating at the back."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":273,"x":220,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Makeshift Killing Supplies Annex, Shop","descriptions":["Crafted of rough wooden boards cobbled together with rusted nails, this wagon looks as though it's ready to fall apart.  Wares are displayed in the center of the room, where they are slightly less likely to be attacked by the termites that infest the mobile shop."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go wagon door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":274,"x":220,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Soulful Trinkets","descriptions":["Lamps are placed around the room haphazardly, offering just enough light to clearly view the merchandise for sale here.  White cloth covers the dark metal walls in an attempt to further brighten the area.  Three racks are strategically placed around the room, their colors signifying the sort of aspects the wares on them represent."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":275,"x":-20,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Sofa So Good, Salesroom","descriptions":["Spacious in extent, the room is floored with broad oak planking sanded smooth and then lacquered to protect the surface.  Vertical oak paneling covers the otherwise undecorated walls.  Sofas, divans, and other seating are displayed throughout the store, ready for purchase."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":276,"x":0,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Skin Art by Jaecinda","descriptions":["The simple wagon lacks any significant decoration.  The walls are bare wood, and large windows provide ample natural lighting while an ink-stained rug, likely once cream colored, covers most of the floor.  A lone workspace exists for Jaecinda to do her work."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go opened doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":277,"x":0,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Sirit's Seafloor Leathers, Main Room","descriptions":["Perfectly tanned hide makes up the walls of this tent, lined along the inside with heavy cream colored cotton.  Rows of fringed scarlet and gold knotwork festoon the entrance, and polished sandalwood tent poles are wrapped in giltworked and embossed suede.  Little copper-tooled incense burners suspended from waxed silk cords send a gentle drift of musk across the room, blending pleasantly with the smell of leather."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":278,"x":40,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Contented Sole, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Giant appliqued fish are affixed to the canvas walls, cut from colorful felt and decorated with googly eyes.  Paper lanterns shaped like various fish species hang from the tent poles, giving light to the room.  Shelves and racks crowd the salesfloor, each one stuffed with a wide selection of footwear."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Contented Sole"]},
  {"id":279,"x":40,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Proud as a Peacock, Sales Floor","descriptions":["The room is a mesmerizing sanctuary of elegance and grace, with vibrant hues and intricate patterns reminiscent of the majestic peacock.  Walls adorned in rich turquoise and deep royal blue hues set the tone, while iridescent feather motifs grace the decor.  Every item  mirrors the splendor of a peacock in full display.  Shelves and racks display the merchandise while clerks help the shoppers."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":280,"x":-20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Reinventing the Wheel, Entry","descriptions":["The aromas of hay and wood are very strong in the small entryway.  Rough cedar planks, comprising the shop's floor, creak beneath the movements of customers.  Two small bales of hay have been used to anchor a large wagon wheel on its end across from the entrance."],"exits":[{"to":281,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":57,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":281,"x":-40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Reinventing the Wheel, West Room","descriptions":["Two circular display boards, painted to resemble wagon wheels, have been mounted upon the walls.  Various images of available merchandise have been placed within the spokes of each display."],"exits":[{"to":280,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":282,"exit":"go","move":"go alcove"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":282,"x":-60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Reinventing the Wheel, Alcove","descriptions":["Resembling a closet more than a room, there is barely enough space for the pine and oak easels that dominate the area.  A small lantern has been hung directly over the easels and sheds just enough light for viewing."],"exits":[{"to":281,"exit":"go","move":"go main room"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":283,"x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Lost Tavern","descriptions":["Dark and gloomy, the atmosphere reflects the abandoned appearance of the area.  Four dingy, vine-covered walls hide faded messages, once legible and now covered in dust and unreadable, while unlit torches are attached to the rounded wooden beams that support the tall roof of this forgotten building.  Small windows covered with dust and grim line the wall above a vine-covered display case.  Scattered around the large room are tables covered with various bottles in a variety of sizes.  A small bar stands next to the dilapidated door."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"go","move":"go driftwood door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Lost Tavern"]},
  {"id":284,"x":-20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Vestibule","descriptions":["A large canvas flap is pulled back to allow ingress and egress for the customers.  The plain canvas walls of the tent are undecorated and billow slightly in the breeze.  Sawdust has been spread across the ground in an effort to control the damage from the passing crowds."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":290,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":58,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["tools"]},
  {"id":285,"x":0,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Outfitting Supplies","descriptions":["Racks and shelves stand against the canvas walls, filled with tools and supplies for sale.  Sawdust covers the ground, the scent of wood mixing with the slightly musty odor of the area."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":290,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":284,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":286,"x":20,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Dyes","descriptions":["Splashes of paint in a myriad of colors cover the canvas walls while colored bins filled with vials are set about the sawdust-covered floor.  A few sales clerks move about, refilling the bins and answering questions from the customers."],"exits":[{"to":287,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":285,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":287,"x":0,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Alchemical Supplies","descriptions":["Lanterns hang from the tent poles as they shed illumination throughout the area.  Tables and shelves display the alchemical tools for sale, with clerks kept busy keeping the items in stock."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":290,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":288,"x":-40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Engineering Supplies","descriptions":["Metal shavings mix with the sawdust on the ground, while the canvas walls are marred by splotches of oil and grease.  Sales clerks bustle about, replenishing the merchandise on the counters and stands."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":287,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":289,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":289,"x":-60,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Enchanting Supplies","descriptions":["The scent of the pine shavings scattered on the ground permeates the area, mingling with the faint hint of brimstone and smoke.  Wooden shelves and racks stand on the sawdust-covered ground, each surface displaying a range of goods for sale."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":290,"x":-40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"More Tool You, Forging Supplies","descriptions":["Stenciled on the canvas tent walls are stylized hammers, tongs, and anvils, matching the various tools displayed as merchandise throughout the area.  A few sales staff stand ready to answer questions or help with purchases."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":285,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":287,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":289,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":291,"x":-100,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Down on the Farm, Salesroom","descriptions":["Small pens and paddocks are set up on the floor, each one filled with tiny animals munching on fodder.  The space overloads the senses with the sounds and smells of a barnyard as the attendents rush around trying to simultaneously help the customers and care for the pets on offer."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"go","move":"go barn door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":292,"x":-120,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Rite of Cravat, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Sturdy brickwork forms the walls around the shop, the bright red of the masonry contrasting with the pale color of the mortar.  Elegant brass sconces hold beeswax candles that illuminate the area with a bright clear light.  Polished wood shelves hold the merchandise while the cheerful clerks stand ready to assist in any way."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":293,"x":-80,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Tougher Than Weather, Main Tent","descriptions":["Murals of storm clouds over various landscapes cover the canvas walls.  Bright lanterns overhead illuminate the space, accentuating the vibrant colors and textures of the products on shelves and racks neatly organized throughout.  A large counter serves as the focal point, where attentive staff stand ready to assist customers."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"go","move":"go grey flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":294,"x":-100,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Jhanine Dering Cloaks, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Diffused light radiates from an ornate chandelier that hangs overhead, adding a layer of richness to the silk-draped walls of this luxurious room.  Deep jewel-tones pattern the plush carpet that rests under a glossy satinwood table.  Polished gold sconces provide a flattering light for the trio of full-length mirrors that occupy one corner.  A pair of cloak racks flanks an ebonwood door."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":295,"x":-120,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Dress for Success, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Sturdy walls of cut grey limestone are topped by large wooden beams supporting the roof.  A few lanterns hang from the roofbeams, illuminating the spacious room and the mannequins displaying the shop's merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":296,"x":-140,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Raw Silk, Shopfloor","descriptions":["Tall stands and racks scattered around the shop exhibit the product while keeping the delicate fabrics off the floor.  The bustle of the clerks as they circulate about mingles with the chatter of the patrons to create a constant background noise."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":297,"x":-100,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Stabbaticals, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Billowy white banners are draped along the walls, framing the wooden pegs and hooks affixed at even intervals around the room.  A cluster of tables rests upon a dark blue rug stretched over the polished oak floor.  Running along the back wall is an intricate mural of a battlefield strewn with broken weaponry and fallen bodies."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"go","move":"go grey door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":298,"x":-100,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Divine Design, Shop","descriptions":["Felt panels are placed over a framework of slender rods that rise in a dome.  Appliques of the many symbols of the gods cover the walls, while the floor is made up of finely polished oak planks laid in a circular pattern radiating from the center.  Wooden shelves hold the merchandise on offer."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"go","move":"go felt flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":299,"x":-120,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Rizadi's Outfitters, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Brass lanterns hang in each corner, spreading a warm glow over the well-tended merchandise and handsomely framed provincial maps that dot the varnished honey-pine walls.  Rows of pewter, brass and copper hooks hang over the iron-banded oak chest that stands near a curtained alcove.  An elaborate globe, inlaid with precious gemstones, rests on the centrally located polished walnut counter."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":300,"x":-120,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Belles, Foyer","descriptions":["A sense of lightness and elegance pervades the room, helped by the richness of the ivory silk-covered walls.  Silver sconces jut out from the walls, holding candles out from polished reflectors.  A small side table against one wall holds some refreshments, and white chairs stand against the two flanking walls."],"exits":[{"to":301,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":60,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":301,"x":-120,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Belles, With This Ring","descriptions":["Subtle but bright lighting ensures that the clientele of this shop can properly appreciate the exquisite merchandise on offering.  Pale birch paneling along the walls adds to the general feeling of light and warmth.  Three display cases - trimmed in teak, ebony, and cherry - hold pride of place in the center of the salesfloor."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":300,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":304,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":302,"x":-100,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Belles, With This Ring","descriptions":["Deeply padded leather armchairs provide spots for lounging and resting before further shopping.  Dark wood paneling of various woods run vertically along the walls to the white plasterwork of the ceiling.  Large chandeliers dangle from the ceiling, illuminating the tables placed in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":301,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":303,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":303,"x":-120,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Bells, Bridal Suite","descriptions":["Instead of wood, the walls are covered in an off-white silk with a subtle shifting pattern of moire watermarks.  A tri-fold mirror stands in one corner while mannequins garbed in luscious fabrics display the shop's bridal wares.  Delicate lamps scattered throughout the area provide copious illumination of the designs and details."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":304,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":304,"x":-140,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Belles, Artful Accouterments","descriptions":["Lit chandeliers provide light now that night has descended, illuminating the cream-colored walls and pale pine floor planking.  Mannequins stand in various poses in one corner.  Large floor to ceiling mirrors allow for the trying on of the merchandise before purchasing.","Skylights admit light that pours over the cream-colored walls and pale pine planking on the floor.  Mannequins stand in various poses in one corner of the room.  Large floor to ceiling mirrors allow for the trying on of the merchandise before purchasing."],"exits":[{"to":303,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":301,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":305,"x":-120,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Cup It!, Main Room","descriptions":["Wide windows are set within latice-work walls that allow the ocean breezes into the structure.  Overhead, palm fronds provide the roof which is upheld by sturdy beams.  A few shelves and racks display the merchandise while a bustling clerk keeps them supplied."],"exits":[{"to":306,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":60,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":306,"x":-100,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Cup It!, Side Room","descriptions":["A cooling breeze flows through this room which has latice-work walls holding up a frond-covered roof.  Windows allow for light to illuminate the tables and stands which display the wares for sale."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":307,"x":-140,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"If You Beard It, Outlet","descriptions":["Whitewashed plaster walls encircle the pale pine planks of the floor on which a few small rugs are scattered.  Set against the walls are a number of racks and shelves that display merchandise.  Clerks circulate amongst the shoppers, refilling depleted wares and answering questions."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"go","move":"go plank door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":308,"x":-140,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Eye Spy","descriptions":["Little more than a closet, this tiny room is lit by what can only charitably called a chandelier -- a simple chain hanging from the ceiling supporting a dirty and chipped lantern.  Two large and bizarre clusters of mannequin heads display spectacles for sale."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"go","move":"go rounded door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":309,"x":40,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Tastelessly Tacky, Vestibule","descriptions":["Crystals encrusted on the walls glitter in the warm glow of the candelabra resting on the white harpsichord positioned in the center of the room.  Next to the instrument is a mannequin dressed in a dazzlingly white ensemble.  A pure white wool rug, its plush pile thick and luxurious, covers the ground."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":312,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":311,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":58,"exit":"go","move":"go purple door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":310,"x":60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Tastelessly Tacky, Clothing","descriptions":["Pink painted walls enclose a wooden floor stained purple.  A bright blue table stands in the middle of the room, displaying various clothing items for sale, with an orange and purple painted chest next to it."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":311,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":311,"x":20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Tastelessly Tacky, Containers","descriptions":["Fake leopard-print wallpaper covers the walls, clashing with the zebra-skin rugs on the black and white checked wooden floor.  A counter, covered with red dyed fur, holds containers for sale."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":309,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":312,"x":60,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Tastelessly Tacky, Pointy Things","descriptions":["Plum-colored watered silk covers the upper walls over a wainscotting of cherrywood.  Matching planks form the floor which peeks out beneath the numerous sheepskins scattered about as carpets.  Wildly painted weapon stands and armor racks display the wares for sale."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":313,"x":-40,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Row Row Row Your Coat, Shop","descriptions":["Oilcloth walls devoid of decoration enclose the shop, the peaked roof upheld by long wooden poles.  Simple stands and shelves are dispersed around the room, each strategically placed under a lantern hanging from the tentpoles.  Clerks circulate throughout, always ready to answer a question or make a sale."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"go","move":"go oilcloth flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":314,"x":-80,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Chuffed To Be Stuffed, Large Workshop","descriptions":["Tone-on-tone white brocade has broken up at intervals with large clear cylinders that rise from oak floor to tent ceiling.  Within each cylinder, a cloud of colored cotton resides, making a veritable rainbow within this large room.  In between each cylinder are shelving units holding a variety of stuffed creatures or other objects.  A large wine barrel has been placed in one corner of the room."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":315,"x":-80,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"The Photash School of Butlery, Offsite Services","descriptions":["Richly colored, elaborate rugs cover the bulk of the wodden floors, and the few spots that remain visible are located in corners and other obscure areas.  Well-dressed clerks stand at the ready to assist patrons as they inspect and question each of the butlers whose services are being marketed.  A light scent of cinnamon lingers throughout the shop."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"go","move":"go cloth-covered doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Photash School of Butlery"]},
  {"id":316,"x":420,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, A Private Forging Room","descriptions":["Thick walls struggle to contain the blistering heat of the workshop where the fires blaze endlessly night and day.  The flickering flames give a reddish glow to the racks and shelves of tools and equipment, all neatly placed and ready for use.  Workers enter in their protective gear from time to time, checking the equipment and reporting back to a sentry at the entry."],"exits":[{"to":190,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":317,"x":60,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Tomes of Lore","descriptions":["The bookstore features stone walls adorned with faded tapestries woven with scenes of historic battles.  Heavy, wooden furniture, including ornate reading desks and oak bookshelves, dominates the space.  Valuable books, some leather-bound with gold leaf lettering, line the shelves.  A faint, musty scent pervades the shop, whose ambience is further enhanced by the soft glow of gaethzen."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":318,"x":80,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Farm in Arms, Salesfloor","descriptions":["Painted to resemble wide planks, the bright red walls billow softly in the breeze.  Thick tent poles hold up the tent's roof, each beam a single beam of rough-cut pine.  A few lanterns hang from the tent poles and provide illumination."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":319,"x":420,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, A Private Alchemy Room","descriptions":["A large workbench dominates one side of the room with numerous pieces of alchemical equipment scattered haphazardly upon its surface.  The high, vented windows provide relief from the common, yet unpleasant, smell that permeates the room."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":320,"x":-40,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lehojen Mitauli Meclagadau","descriptions":["The sounds of the festivities taking place outside are subdued and distorted here as they echo repeatedly off the cavernous stone walls.  A sloping tunnel descends further underground before curving back upwards.  From this vantage point, whatever lies at the end of the tunnel seems well lit as shadows are cast towards the inflection point.  A faint, sweet, and earthy scent lingers in the air."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":102,"exit":"go","move":"go cave opening"}],"aliases":["teardrinkers"]},
  {"id":321,"x":-40,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lehojen Mitauli Meclagadau","descriptions":["Suspended from the ceiling high above are brilliantly illuminated globes, each a different color ranging from cool blues and royal purples to fiery reds and sunny yellows.  Merelew clad in armor pass through from time to time, moving further into the opening chamber and are frequently escorted by frantic visitors or fellow Merelew.  A heavy pollen scent fills the air."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":322,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":320,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":324,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":322,"x":-20,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lehojen Mitauli Meclagadau","descriptions":["Shovels, picks, and other gardening tools are scattered haphazardly from toppled crates.  Every pair of pruning shears seems to have been soundly broken or disassembled, their pieces tossed wildly about with some blades even lodged into the walls.  A heavy layer of pollen coats everything with colorful, glitter-like dust.  The overhead lighting casts ominous shadows, as if beasts were crawling amongst the illuminating orbs above."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":324,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":323,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":323,"x":-40,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lehojen Mitauli Meclagadau","descriptions":["Storage holes, slots, shelves and more are carved into the cavern's walls and stalagmites that rise up from the smoothed stone floor -- all packed full of neatly tied bundles of dried or drying herbs and medicinal plants.  Rows upon rows of cambrinth-capped Wayerd pyramids and mixing jars are lined up, though many have been toppled, smashed and substantially damaged."],"exits":[{"to":322,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":321,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":324,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":324,"x":-60,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Andreshlew, Lehojen Mitauli Meclagadau","descriptions":["Small puddles of water have formed throughout the area as the humidity forms condensation that drips from the walls and ceiling.  Some clever stonework successfully redirects much of the water into recessed, well-like structures carved into the walls.  Raised stone planters that once held plants, saplings and other specimens have been knocked from their pedestals, scattering soil -- now mud -- and dying plants alike."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":322,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":321,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":325,"x":460,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, A Private Outfitting Room","descriptions":["A pure-white wainscoted hall is topped by lilac-hued paisley painted walls.  Occupying the back third of the room is a solid-looking loom, while a large spinning wheel sits near the entrance.  Resting atop a deep purple rug is a sturdy worktable and a comfortable, wicker chair.  Running parallel along opposing walls are several hooks and shelves, holding practically every conceivable tool, spool of thread, bobbin, thimble and scrap."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":326,"x":440,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Craftsmen's Academy, A Private Enchanting Room","descriptions":["Pieced together by a seemingly blind worker, the walls are covered with scraps of rugs, blankets, and carpets in a kaleidoscope of colors.  A burly, light pink feldspar table is stashed in a corner of the room, providing plenty of room to work."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"go","move":"go guarded doorway"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":402,"x":240,"y":-310,"z":0,"title":"High on the Frog, Entrance","descriptions":["Set in the corners are four polished brass braziers that illuminate the entryway with flickering flames.  Canvas walls wave slightly in the breeze, the pale blue bands at their bottom swaying much like the waves on the ocean.  Wood shavings are spread on the ground, the faint pine scent mixing with the faint smoky smell from the braziers."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":403,"x":240,"y":-330,"z":0,"title":"High on the Frog, Front Room","descriptions":["All along the canvas walls are a series of stylized frogs painted in shades of green and brown.  A few are hopping while others are sitting or attempting to capture flying insects.  Overhead a series of brass lanterns illuminate the shop's merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":404,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":402,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":405,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":404,"x":260,"y":-350,"z":0,"title":"High on the Frog, Side Chamber","descriptions":["Stenciled onto the center of each canvas panel is a bulging-eyed frog staring straight out into the room.  Flanking each frog is a stylized lily bloom, done in white paint.  A few racks and shelves are scattered about the shaving-covered ground."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":405,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":405,"x":220,"y":-350,"z":0,"title":"High on the Frog, Side Alcove","descriptions":["Standing in the center of the room is a human-sized wooden sculpture of a giant frog, its eyes bulging and long tongue hanging out.  Painted stands circle the statue, keeping the curious from getting close while simultaneously displaying wares for sale.  The ground is covered with pine shavings that add their fresh scent to the faint oil and leather odors of the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":404,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":403,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000"}
 ],
